(1268604, 162237, 6008, '<td valign="top">The color contrast between dog and grass is good. I''m not sure whether it''s a mixture of bad focus and neatimage or one or the other but there seems to be patches of detail and no detail that is a little offputting. The image also seems a little soft.</td>', 'The color contrast between dog and grass is good. I''m not sure whether it''s a mixture of bad focus and neatimage or one or the other but there seems to be patches of detail and no detail that is a little offputting. The image also seems a little soft.', '2005-04-04 01:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268608, 161971, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally care for the depth of field on the frog, I''d like for his arms to be in focus...just my opinion though.</td>', 'I don''t personally care for the depth of field on the frog, I''d like for his arms to be in focus...just my opinion though.', '2005-04-04 01:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268610, 163080, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings....<br/> <br/>This photo is a nice profile shot, but there are a few issues that you should consider here...  1. The background is a little powerful for the subject.  There are a lot of strong lines and contrasts there that make the image a bit ''busy'' overall.  2. The image is a little soft in some key areas, probably due to a shallow depth of field aperture setting on the camera.  3.  The light provided by the flash is creating a lot of harsh contrast in the image.  <br/> <br/>Without the title here, i would have trouble determining that this dog is in a box with this tight composition.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings.... This photo is a nice profile shot, but there are a few issues that you should consider here...  1. The background is a little powerful for the subject.  There are a lot of strong lines and contrasts there that make the image a bit ''busy'' overall.  2. The image is a little soft in some key areas, probably due to a shallow depth of field aperture setting on the camera.  3.  The light provided by the flash is creating a lot of harsh contrast in the image.   Without the title here, i would have trouble determining that this dog is in a box with this tight composition.   ', '2005-04-04 01:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
