(1268614, 163049, 28742, '<td valign="top">I like the setup, I like the photo - only thing that I don''t like is the rope color - distracting. Maybe shoulda unsat''d. Nice job though.</td>', 'I like the setup, I like the photo - only thing that I don''t like is the rope color - distracting. Maybe shoulda unsat''d. Nice job though.', '2005-04-04 01:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
