(1268618, 163087, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful snake.  Love the colors and the textures, and you''ve framed this very nicely.  The skull is a really great prop.  That black background just makes all the colors really pop too.  I used to own a 13 foot Burmese so I have a soft spot for snakes.</td>', 'Beautiful snake.  Love the colors and the textures, and you''ve framed this very nicely.  The skull is a really great prop.  That black background just makes all the colors really pop too.  I used to own a 13 foot Burmese so I have a soft spot for snakes.', '2005-04-04 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
