(1268627, 162812, 6008, '<td valign="top">Yeesh, black dogs are soooooooooooooo hard to photograph. You did well getting details in the majority of the fur. I like the traditional profile shot associated with scotties too, plus the ribbon. I think this is an excellent shot considering the technical difficulties to pull it off right.</td>', 'Yeesh, black dogs are soooooooooooooo hard to photograph. You did well getting details in the majority of the fur. I like the traditional profile shot associated with scotties too, plus the ribbon. I think this is an excellent shot considering the technical difficulties to pull it off right.', '2005-04-04 01:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
