(1268908, 162863, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the combination of the pink boa versus the light color of the dog.<br/>Other than that, this is superbly done portrait - wonderful setup, lighting, background, pose etc etc etc. An 8 from me</td>', 'I don''t care for the combination of the pink boa versus the light color of the dog.Other than that, this is superbly done portrait - wonderful setup, lighting, background, pose etc etc etc. An 8 from me', '2005-04-04 02:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268910, 162564, 25464, '<td valign="top">What a great face.  I would have loved to see a face shot from this angle and background  Showing the partial body,  especially cropping off the feet, really detracts from what could have been an amazing face shot.</td>', 'What a great face.  I would have loved to see a face shot from this angle and background  Showing the partial body,  especially cropping off the feet, really detracts from what could have been an amazing face shot.', '2005-04-04 02:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268911, 163091, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is fine portraiture indeed.  Really like this.</td>', 'This is fine portraiture indeed.  Really like this.', '2005-04-04 02:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268913, 163104, 6519, '<td valign="top">Lovely setup, pose, lighting. Good job</td>', 'Lovely setup, pose, lighting. Good job', '2005-04-04 02:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268915, 162850, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes, but I do wish there was a bit more.</td>', 'Nice eyes, but I do wish there was a bit more.', '2005-04-04 02:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268918, 162800, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am usually a fan of extreme close crop however this one is lacking because the eye on the right is just too dark.  I also would have left the ear in the shot.  This doggy has great personality I bet.</td>', 'I am usually a fan of extreme close crop however this one is lacking because the eye on the right is just too dark.  I also would have left the ear in the shot.  This doggy has great personality I bet.', '2005-04-04 02:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
