(1268931, 162820, 6668, '<td valign="top">The light glare on the wall is very distracting, as is the stuffed dog to me, makes it more of a snapshot in my opinion than a portrait.</td>', 'The light glare on the wall is very distracting, as is the stuffed dog to me, makes it more of a snapshot in my opinion than a portrait.', '2005-04-04 02:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
