(1268934, 163087, 35547, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting and composition, nicely done.</td>', 'Awesome lighting and composition, nicely done.', '2005-04-04 02:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268935, 160944, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great eyes.  The tone is a little odd IMO.  The dead centered composition could have been improved by cropping the empty space on the right, and including the tip of the ear.  Still very nice.  I love that you can see the detail of the whiskers against the darker background of the body.</td>', 'Great eyes.  The tone is a little odd IMO.  The dead centered composition could have been improved by cropping the empty space on the right, and including the tip of the ear.  Still very nice.  I love that you can see the detail of the whiskers against the darker background of the body.', '2005-04-04 02:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
