(1268970, 163043, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one had potential, but the blown highlight on the nose makes the face look almost deformed.  The nose blends right in with the white of the face.  Beautiful cat, and great composition.  Eyes look like they could have been amazing.  Harsh lighting is the only real problem here.</td>', 'This one had potential, but the blown highlight on the nose makes the face look almost deformed.  The nose blends right in with the white of the face.  Beautiful cat, and great composition.  Eyes look like they could have been amazing.  Harsh lighting is the only real problem here.', '2005-04-04 02:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268971, 162674, 6349, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo but there seems to have been a strange mixture of sharpening and softening in areas of the fur on the face.</td>', 'beautiful photo but there seems to have been a strange mixture of sharpening and softening in areas of the fur on the face.', '2005-04-04 02:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268972, 162674, 33145, '<td valign="top">looks like fur that''s been neat-imaged - too smooth - which is a shame because it''s a nice shot with nice light.</td>', 'looks like fur that''s been neat-imaged - too smooth - which is a shame because it''s a nice shot with nice light.', '2005-04-04 02:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268975, 162741, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot.  The exposure is excellent for a dark colored cat and the pose is so catlike.</td>', 'I really like this a lot.  The exposure is excellent for a dark colored cat and the pose is so catlike.', '2005-04-04 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268976, 162883, 6519, '<td valign="top">LOVE your subject, but I don''t care for the color treatment nor the very busy background.</td>', 'LOVE your subject, but I don''t care for the color treatment nor the very busy background.', '2005-04-04 02:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268977, 162985, 25464, '<td valign="top">The shadow, while possibly intentional, is the only thing I find distracting about this one.  The light is just too flat.  Pose is great, and eyes are really pretty.</td>', 'The shadow, while possibly intentional, is the only thing I find distracting about this one.  The light is just too flat.  Pose is great, and eyes are really pretty.', '2005-04-04 02:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268979, 161390, 6349, '<td valign="top">Splendid!  Dog and a cat and great peaceful lighting and poses.  this is the stuff animal calendars are made of.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Splendid!  Dog and a cat and great peaceful lighting and poses.  this is the stuff animal calendars are made of.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-04-04 02:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268980, 162926, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I would recommend more neck and less space at the top.  Good though.</td>', 'Nice.  I would recommend more neck and less space at the top.  Good though.', '2005-04-04 02:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268982, 162725, 6349, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous black and white.  The whiskers really make this shot and make the centering of the subject seem like a wise choice.</td>', 'Gorgeous black and white.  The whiskers really make this shot and make the centering of the subject seem like a wise choice.', '2005-04-04 02:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268983, 161682, 33145, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Almost like a painting - so rich. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful. Almost like a painting - so rich. 9.', '2005-04-04 02:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268985, 161996, 33145, '<td valign="top">This one''s going to be hard to beat. Great looking pet, great composition and pose.</td>', 'This one''s going to be hard to beat. Great looking pet, great composition and pose.', '2005-04-04 02:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
