(1269421, 162413, 24983, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the natural frame and you have got a good look from the cat, I would have scored higher if the back ground was not so overexposed, to avoid this you should s expose fo the backgroud and then set your flash to give 1 stop LESS light,. IE if the background was say  F11@ 1/125 suse this setting but set your flash to give you F5.6 Of if you want a lighter shot to F8 that will keep the back ground the correct tones.  6</td>', 'Nice idea with the natural frame and you have got a good look from the cat, I would have scored higher if the back ground was not so overexposed, to avoid this you should s expose fo the backgroud and then set your flash to give 1 stop LESS light,. IE if the background was say  F11@ 1/125 suse this setting but set your flash to give you F5.6 Of if you want a lighter shot to F8 that will keep the back ground the correct tones.  6', '2005-04-04 06:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
