(1269598, 163060, 34402, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you are a Photoshop user, but you may want to look for a tool to soften up the edges after an extraction to lessen the jagged edges. Not sure if feathering is an option as well. I use PSP, so I can''t be more specific. It''s a great shot, I do like the composition, the biggest detraction is the rough edges.</td>', 'Not sure if you are a Photoshop user, but you may want to look for a tool to soften up the edges after an extraction to lessen the jagged edges. Not sure if feathering is an option as well. I use PSP, so I can''t be more specific. It''s a great shot, I do like the composition, the biggest detraction is the rough edges.', '2005-04-04 09:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
