(1271237, 162940, 22975, '<td valign="top">I love the Chinese Crested!!!  And I love this photo!  A true standout in this challenge.  <br/> <br/>Edited: I can''t believe that''s a terrier!  I just new it was a Chinese Crested.  Must be the haircut.  ;)  PS This should have finished top 10, IMHO.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-12 09:23:44.</i></td>', 'I love the Chinese Crested!!!  And I love this photo!  A true standout in this challenge.   Edited: I can''t believe that''s a terrier!  I just new it was a Chinese Crested.  Must be the haircut.  ;)  PS This should have finished top 10, IMHO.', '2005-04-04 22:11:58.000000', '2005-04-12 10:23:44.000000', 1),
(1271238, 162717, 22975, '<td valign="top">Great photo of a great dog.  I love boxers!  :)</td>', 'Great photo of a great dog.  I love boxers!  :)', '2005-04-04 22:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271240, 163089, 22975, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT pet portrait.  You''re lucky to have such a photogenic dog!  Wish mine would sit still for such a cute pose!</td>', 'EXCELLENT pet portrait.  You''re lucky to have such a photogenic dog!  Wish mine would sit still for such a cute pose!', '2005-04-04 22:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271241, 162819, 22975, '<td valign="top">Such a cool photo...  not so much it''s a true portrait, but it''s really cool, nonetheless.</td>', 'Such a cool photo...  not so much it''s a true portrait, but it''s really cool, nonetheless.', '2005-04-04 22:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271245, 162279, 22975, '<td valign="top">What a BEAUTIFUL dog!!  I wish the crop wasn''t quite so tight, but it''s cute anyway!!  :)</td>', 'What a BEAUTIFUL dog!!  I wish the crop wasn''t quite so tight, but it''s cute anyway!!  :)', '2005-04-04 22:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271250, 162769, 25899, '<td valign="top">Nice colours!<br/>Only thing is the fact that the framing is a tad off, but except from that it''s a nice pussy shot ;)</td>', 'Nice colours!Only thing is the fact that the framing is a tad off, but except from that it''s a nice pussy shot ;)', '2005-04-04 22:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271251, 161996, 22975, '<td valign="top">Kick-butt portrait.  So symmetrical, it''s too cool!  I wish the lighting was more even on the eyes, but really, this is awesome... it''s a 9.</td>', 'Kick-butt portrait.  So symmetrical, it''s too cool!  I wish the lighting was more even on the eyes, but really, this is awesome... it''s a 9.', '2005-04-04 22:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271256, 161480, 22975, '<td valign="top">OF COURSE!!  I should have taken a photo of my iCybie!!  At least he would have sat still for the photo (with the battery out, at least)!!  Great idea!</td>', 'OF COURSE!!  I should have taken a photo of my iCybie!!  At least he would have sat still for the photo (with the battery out, at least)!!  Great idea!', '2005-04-04 22:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271264, 162754, 22975, '<td valign="top">Sweet little sleepy dog...  I really like the contrast in spots and stripes.  If that wasn''t intentional, just tell everyone it was!  ;)  I really like this, it''s my style, so 9 for you.</td>', 'Sweet little sleepy dog...  I really like the contrast in spots and stripes.  If that wasn''t intentional, just tell everyone it was!  ;)  I really like this, it''s my style, so 9 for you.', '2005-04-04 22:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271265, 161985, 22975, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This is great!!  :)</td>', 'LOL!  This is great!!  :)', '2005-04-04 22:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271267, 162804, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, where to begin.  Well, first, it doesn''t come off as a portrait to me, mor of a snapshot type picture.  Yes, it is set up, obviously but still just a nice snap shot.  The light is a bit harsh and the background is very distracting on the left, mayber if you had come from a different angle?  There are a lot of little distracting things in this shot, the white line above the head, the people in the v of the leg and motorcycle and all the stuff in the baskets.  I''m sorry but a 3 for this one.</td>', 'Wow, where to begin.  Well, first, it doesn''t come off as a portrait to me, mor of a snapshot type picture.  Yes, it is set up, obviously but still just a nice snap shot.  The light is a bit harsh and the background is very distracting on the left, mayber if you had come from a different angle?  There are a lot of little distracting things in this shot, the white line above the head, the people in the v of the leg and motorcycle and all the stuff in the baskets.  I''m sorry but a 3 for this one.', '2005-04-04 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271270, 162686, 22975, '<td valign="top">Pets and flashes don''t always mix.  :)  I like the set-up, though!  Points for atmosphere!</td>', 'Pets and flashes don''t always mix.  :)  I like the set-up, though!  Points for atmosphere!', '2005-04-04 22:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271271, 162990, 22975, '<td valign="top">The colors in this make it look like an oil painting!  It''s really beautiful.</td>', 'The colors in this make it look like an oil painting!  It''s really beautiful.', '2005-04-04 22:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271272, 162275, 22975, '<td valign="top">ummmmmmmmmmmmmm...</td>', 'ummmmmmmmmmmmmm...', '2005-04-04 22:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271274, 163107, 22975, '<td valign="top">W.O.W.  You''re a pro, for sure!  If I could give you an 11, I would.</td>', 'W.O.W.  You''re a pro, for sure!  If I could give you an 11, I would.', '2005-04-04 22:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271276, 161114, 12448, '<td valign="top">And what a nice pet that is, but to me really doesn''t qualify for the portrait aspect of the challenge.  If you had just gone for a shot of the camera, putting it in a portrait setting you might have done much better but this is just s snapshot of you taking a nice picture of flowers.  Also the edges around you and the flowers is too defined and applying the blur was a good idea, the end image is a bit disconcerting.  Sorry, a 3</td>', 'And what a nice pet that is, but to me really doesn''t qualify for the portrait aspect of the challenge.  If you had just gone for a shot of the camera, putting it in a portrait setting you might have done much better but this is just s snapshot of you taking a nice picture of flowers.  Also the edges around you and the flowers is too defined and applying the blur was a good idea, the end image is a bit disconcerting.  Sorry, a 3', '2005-04-04 22:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271278, 162818, 22975, '<td valign="top">Great cat portrait (and I''m not a cat person, so that''s REALLY a compliment).  I love the lighting and the cat''s expression.  Great job.</td>', 'Great cat portrait (and I''m not a cat person, so that''s REALLY a compliment).  I love the lighting and the cat''s expression.  Great job.', '2005-04-04 22:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271279, 161275, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice snapshot of your cat stretching, if the eyes were open and there were some motion blur in the background you might have pulled this off! :)  A 4</td>', 'Very nice snapshot of your cat stretching, if the eyes were open and there were some motion blur in the background you might have pulled this off! :)  A 4', '2005-04-04 22:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271282, 161072, 22975, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!  Icky pet, but I won''t take points away for that.  Plus, that weird tail is pretty cool...</td>', 'Nice composition!  Icky pet, but I won''t take points away for that.  Plus, that weird tail is pretty cool...', '2005-04-04 22:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271284, 162982, 22975, '<td valign="top">great eyes!  this is a nice portrait!  :)</td>', 'great eyes!  this is a nice portrait!  :)', '2005-04-04 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271286, 162915, 22975, '<td valign="top">LOVE your dog, what a sweetie!!</td>', 'LOVE your dog, what a sweetie!!', '2005-04-04 22:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
