(1271455, 161390, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job ! A ribbon contender to please both cat and dog camps. Great use of shadow and light. Love the power of your dog and the serenity of your cat. What deep colors and those cat stripes are something else. Should sell copies to vets, PETCO, etc. Good luck on this ribbon submission. -10-</td>', 'Wow, great job ! A ribbon contender to please both cat and dog camps. Great use of shadow and light. Love the power of your dog and the serenity of your cat. What deep colors and those cat stripes are something else. Should sell copies to vets, PETCO, etc. Good luck on this ribbon submission. -10-', '2005-04-04 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
