(1271470, 162856, 34985, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture. I love the expression on their faces. I think it looks good in b&amp;w.  :)</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture. I love the expression on their faces. I think it looks good in b&w.  :)', '2005-04-04 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271489, 163059, 24065, '<td valign="top">Your choice of black and white was wise -- it helps lessen the distraction of the background.  The dog is beautiful, there''s light in his eyes, and he''s nicely in focus.  I can''t figure out why you used selective desaturation here.  It draws attention to the dog''s toy rather than the main subject, the beautiful dog.  I''m tired tonight, so hope this isn''t coming across harshly -- I hope it is helpful feedback.  :)</td>', 'Your choice of black and white was wise -- it helps lessen the distraction of the background.  The dog is beautiful, there''s light in his eyes, and he''s nicely in focus.  I can''t figure out why you used selective desaturation here.  It draws attention to the dog''s toy rather than the main subject, the beautiful dog.  I''m tired tonight, so hope this isn''t coming across harshly -- I hope it is helpful feedback.  :)', '2005-04-05 00:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
