(1271527, 162819, 31214, '<td valign="top">Wow....great catch.  I''m betting this will be a top 10.  I love the reflection in the sand and the water spray.  It all adds to the festive mood.</td>', 'Wow....great catch.  I''m betting this will be a top 10.  I love the reflection in the sand and the water spray.  It all adds to the festive mood.', '2005-04-05 00:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271528, 161810, 28084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Some people might say they don''t like the dirt specks and might even think it''s sensor dust, but we know you''ve got a cat who likes to roll around on hard surfaces outside, don''t you? One of our top 3 pics.</td>', 'Beautiful. Some people might say they don''t like the dirt specks and might even think it''s sensor dust, but we know you''ve got a cat who likes to roll around on hard surfaces outside, don''t you? One of our top 3 pics.', '2005-04-05 00:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271529, 162800, 31214, '<td valign="top">I love the way the nose consumes most of the space in the photo.  Great capture and expression.</td>', 'I love the way the nose consumes most of the space in the photo.  Great capture and expression.', '2005-04-05 00:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271532, 162686, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my secong go-around  =) - Very creative idea!  For some reason the cat looks like he/she was cut out and placed in the picture.  Maybe too much post-processing?  Also, the cat''s coat could use a little more detail... a silver or gold reflector to the right would have looked nice.</td>', 'This is my secong go-around  =) - Very creative idea!  For some reason the cat looks like he/she was cut out and placed in the picture.  Maybe too much post-processing?  Also, the cat''s coat could use a little more detail... a silver or gold reflector to the right would have looked nice.', '2005-04-05 00:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271536, 162824, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my secong go-around  =) - Awh... so cute!  I only think that the picture could use a little more contrast and that the flowers to the left are a little distracting.</td>', 'This is my secong go-around  =) - Awh... so cute!  I only think that the picture could use a little more contrast and that the flowers to the left are a little distracting.', '2005-04-05 00:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271540, 162610, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my secong go-around  =) - Awh... so cute!  I only think that the background is a little too distracting... I would have burned it a little, and possibly cloned out some of the white flowers around Kobi''s face.  Otherwise, good job!</td>', 'This is my secong go-around  =) - Awh... so cute!  I only think that the background is a little too distracting... I would have burned it a little, and possibly cloned out some of the white flowers around Kobi''s face.  Otherwise, good job!', '2005-04-05 00:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271542, 161472, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my secong go-around  =) - I am not too crazy about all of the over-exposure.  But thinking this was intentional... I would have liked to see the photo cropped a little differently... the great dane''s eyes are in the center of the photograph (eyes are normally the focus of portraits) so I would have centered the dog differently (rule of thirds).</td>', 'This is my secong go-around  =) - I am not too crazy about all of the over-exposure.  But thinking this was intentional... I would have liked to see the photo cropped a little differently... the great dane''s eyes are in the center of the photograph (eyes are normally the focus of portraits) so I would have centered the dog differently (rule of thirds).', '2005-04-05 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271544, 161682, 25464, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting you might find on royal walls.  Beautiful.  I am not generally a fan of PS overkill.  I think this is a bit over the top, but works quite well.</td>', 'Looks like a painting you might find on royal walls.  Beautiful.  I am not generally a fan of PS overkill.  I think this is a bit over the top, but works quite well.', '2005-04-05 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271546, 163042, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my secong go-around  =) - - awh... so cute!  I like the peaceful feeling of your photograph.  I would have cropped it so your AC was out of the photograph (minor detail), Also, her legs are a little too over-exposed... difficult to see which leg is which  =)  Otherwise, great photograph!</td>', 'This is my secong go-around  =) - - awh... so cute!  I like the peaceful feeling of your photograph.  I would have cropped it so your AC was out of the photograph (minor detail), Also, her legs are a little too over-exposed... difficult to see which leg is which  =)  Otherwise, great photograph!', '2005-04-05 00:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271550, 161682, 6668, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning, looks like a painting, I love the richness of the colors. I predict a winner! 10</td>', 'Absolutely stunning, looks like a painting, I love the richness of the colors. I predict a winner! 10', '2005-04-05 00:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271551, 162678, 6668, '<td valign="top">What is that stuffed doggy doing to that poor bunny??? LOL Personally I feel the portrait would be stronger without the stuffed doggy also I find the background to be rather distracting.</td>', 'What is that stuffed doggy doing to that poor bunny??? LOL Personally I feel the portrait would be stronger without the stuffed doggy also I find the background to be rather distracting.', '2005-04-05 00:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
