(1271554, 163055, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this is beautiful.  Light and detail are great.  The only thing I find the slightest bit distracting are the blurred blades of grass in the foreground.  Great job Brad?</td>', 'I think this is beautiful.  Light and detail are great.  The only thing I find the slightest bit distracting are the blurred blades of grass in the foreground.  Great job Brad?', '2005-04-05 00:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
