(1271556, 162713, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am usually very good at finding something to pick on in everyones photos.  Not here.  Great work.  The eyes are key and these are great.</td>', 'I am usually very good at finding something to pick on in everyones photos.  Not here.  Great work.  The eyes are key and these are great.', '2005-04-05 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271557, 162421, 24951, '<td valign="top">Great background Love the angle</td>', 'Great background Love the angle', '2005-04-05 00:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271563, 161996, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like the symetry of this shot.  This works quite nicely as a dead center composition.  The only thing keeping this out of my 10s is the odd shadow in the eye on the left.  A tiny bit more light on that side would make this perfect.  Great work.</td>', 'I really like the symetry of this shot.  This works quite nicely as a dead center composition.  The only thing keeping this out of my 10s is the odd shadow in the eye on the left.  A tiny bit more light on that side would make this perfect.  Great work.', '2005-04-05 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271564, 162781, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus to me, also not a very interesting subject</td>', 'seems out of focus to me, also not a very interesting subject', '2005-04-05 00:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271568, 163079, 6668, '<td valign="top">He seems to have almost tied himself in a knot lol.  The front of the snake seems out of focus to me and overall it''s not a very interesting shot in my opinion, seems more of a snapshot to me than a portrait...sorry.</td>', 'He seems to have almost tied himself in a knot lol.  The front of the snake seems out of focus to me and overall it''s not a very interesting shot in my opinion, seems more of a snapshot to me than a portrait...sorry.', '2005-04-05 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271570, 161963, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - Cute!  I just would have not positioned him on your hand like that.  Your pinky finger it very distracting and takes away from your pet... along with your watch.  The lighting also looks a little off... looks like you are using your camera''s built in flash.  If you do not have an off-camera or horseshoe flash, then use natural light from a window... will be more flattering.</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - Cute!  I just would have not positioned him on your hand like that.  Your pinky finger it very distracting and takes away from your pet... along with your watch.  The lighting also looks a little off... looks like you are using your camera''s built in flash.  If you do not have an off-camera or horseshoe flash, then use natural light from a window... will be more flattering.', '2005-04-05 00:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271571, 161746, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful animal and nice composition with the exception of the missing lower half of the legs.  I would recommend including either no legs or all of the legs in the shot.  Another issue is the lighting/flash.  The shadow on the wall is a bit distracting.  I like the upward angle and the choice of background.</td>', 'This is a beautiful animal and nice composition with the exception of the missing lower half of the legs.  I would recommend including either no legs or all of the legs in the shot.  Another issue is the lighting/flash.  The shadow on the wall is a bit distracting.  I like the upward angle and the choice of background.', '2005-04-05 00:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271572, 163104, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Awhhh.... so cute!  I really like your composition... I''d only suggest burnign the background to the left a little more... the black looks faded and I think if it''s darker than your bunny''s head will stand out more.  Otherwise, great job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Awhhh.... so cute!  I really like your composition... I''d only suggest burnign the background to the left a little more... the black looks faded and I think if it''s darker than your bunny''s head will stand out more.  Otherwise, great job!', '2005-04-05 00:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271576, 162737, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Cute puppy!  However, your photograph looks very blurry and out of focus.  The lighting also looks really harsh on the left... I would have liked to see it filtered more.</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Cute puppy!  However, your photograph looks very blurry and out of focus.  The lighting also looks really harsh on the left... I would have liked to see it filtered more.', '2005-04-05 00:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271577, 163106, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great pose and amazing eyes.</td>', 'Great pose and amazing eyes.', '2005-04-05 00:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271578, 161418, 25464, '<td valign="top">Top notch.</td>', 'Top notch.', '2005-04-05 00:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271584, 162818, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Awh... veyr cute kitty!!!  I the over-exposed area on kitty''s chest is a little distracting... takes away from his/her beautiful face.  Next time I would use either more filtered light (I use a softbox or window with white curtains)... I do not thinking burning in that area w/photoshop would do much.</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Awh... veyr cute kitty!!!  I the over-exposed area on kitty''s chest is a little distracting... takes away from his/her beautiful face.  Next time I would use either more filtered light (I use a softbox or window with white curtains)... I do not thinking burning in that area w/photoshop would do much.', '2005-04-05 00:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271587, 161389, 25464, '<td valign="top">The only thing I see wrong with this shot is the angle.  The down the ear angle is not flattering.  Beautiful eyes.</td>', 'The only thing I see wrong with this shot is the angle.  The down the ear angle is not flattering.  Beautiful eyes.', '2005-04-05 00:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271595, 161869, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great great eyes.  I would have cropped this much closer to eliminate the distracting elements of the house.  In on the right to the shoulder and on the left to balance.  Beautiful dog.</td>', 'Great great eyes.  I would have cropped this much closer to eliminate the distracting elements of the house.  In on the right to the shoulder and on the left to balance.  Beautiful dog.', '2005-04-05 00:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271596, 161791, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the personality of this curious cat.</td>', 'Great capture of the personality of this curious cat.', '2005-04-05 00:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271597, 161503, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark treatment here.  It really shows off the detail captured.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like the dark treatment here.  It really shows off the detail captured.  Good job.', '2005-04-05 00:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271600, 162718, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  - Cute kitty!  Reminds me of my old kitty  =)  The photograph looks very pixellated, maybe it was saved at too low of a resolution or cropped too small.  I also wish the ears were not cropped right there... either do not crop the ears, or crop the overall picture more.  It also looks like his/her face was dodged to bring out more detail (or lightened too much).  A great way to photograph dark/black animals is to use a gold reflector... it really brings out the detail in fur without having to post-process and lose important details.  I hope this helps  =)</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  - Cute kitty!  Reminds me of my old kitty  =)  The photograph looks very pixellated, maybe it was saved at too low of a resolution or cropped too small.  I also wish the ears were not cropped right there... either do not crop the ears, or crop the overall picture more.  It also looks like his/her face was dodged to bring out more detail (or lightened too much).  A great way to photograph dark/black animals is to use a gold reflector... it really brings out the detail in fur without having to post-process and lose important details.  I hope this helps  =)', '2005-04-05 00:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271606, 162769, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - Very beautiful and rich photo!  Great job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - Very beautiful and rich photo!  Great job!', '2005-04-05 00:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1271608, 163105, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - How''d you get him to do that!  haha!!!  Great photo!  I wish it was cropped a little differently... her eye is too in the center of the photograph... in portraits the eyes tend to be the real focus.  I think this photo would be stronger if his head was more to the left and had more open space on the right.  Otherwise, great job!  I love it!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - How''d you get him to do that!  haha!!!  Great photo!  I wish it was cropped a little differently... her eye is too in the center of the photograph... in portraits the eyes tend to be the real focus.  I think this photo would be stronger if his head was more to the left and had more open space on the right.  Otherwise, great job!  I love it!', '2005-04-05 00:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
