(1272039, 161837, 35122, '<td valign="top">this pic is hilarious...I''m thinking what a great story he/she would make....love it!!!</td>', 'this pic is hilarious...I''m thinking what a great story he/she would make....love it!!!', '2005-04-05 09:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272040, 161440, 21375, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen more sharpness for his head area.  It kinda blurs out just a bit too soon.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen more sharpness for his head area.  It kinda blurs out just a bit too soon.', '2005-04-05 09:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272042, 161983, 35122, '<td valign="top">beautiful....those paws are huge...</td>', 'beautiful....those paws are huge...', '2005-04-05 09:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272043, 162495, 21375, '<td valign="top">Background too dark, can''t see all of his features.  That makes a nice shot, but just not my "preference".</td>', 'Background too dark, can''t see all of his features.  That makes a nice shot, but just not my "preference".', '2005-04-05 09:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272047, 163077, 21375, '<td valign="top">Colors are AWESOME.  Detail of his feathers GREAT.   Good job.</td>', 'Colors are AWESOME.  Detail of his feathers GREAT.   Good job.', '2005-04-05 09:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272048, 161562, 21375, '<td valign="top">Good idea to use coat to give Chewy some contrast to the sofa.</td>', 'Good idea to use coat to give Chewy some contrast to the sofa.', '2005-04-05 09:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272049, 162971, 21375, '<td valign="top">EEEEEEKKKKKKK - but great detail.</td>', 'EEEEEEKKKKKKK - but great detail.', '2005-04-05 09:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272050, 161175, 21375, '<td valign="top">Love the white coat and the lighting... would like to see more detail in an eye.</td>', 'Love the white coat and the lighting... would like to see more detail in an eye.', '2005-04-05 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272051, 163018, 35122, '<td valign="top">gorgeous...very poised...excellent photo...love the black and white...</td>', 'gorgeous...very poised...excellent photo...love the black and white...', '2005-04-05 09:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272052, 161747, 21375, '<td valign="top">I have an old cat with the same look and expression.  She''s only 15 though.  Great use of the mirror.  I love her cloudy eyes.  You caught the "age" well.</td>', 'I have an old cat with the same look and expression.  She''s only 15 though.  Great use of the mirror.  I love her cloudy eyes.  You caught the "age" well.', '2005-04-05 09:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272053, 162754, 35122, '<td valign="top">ahhhhhh...how cute is that....</td>', 'ahhhhhh...how cute is that....', '2005-04-05 09:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272054, 162940, 21375, '<td valign="top">The colors are so well done with great contrasts.  The "beak" (John''s expression) shadow is great to accent his little pointy nose.  The eyes tell it all.  Great job.  A 10.</td>', 'The colors are so well done with great contrasts.  The "beak" (John''s expression) shadow is great to accent his little pointy nose.  The eyes tell it all.  Great job.  A 10.', '2005-04-05 09:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272056, 162990, 35122, '<td valign="top">beautiful...10</td>', 'beautiful...10', '2005-04-05 09:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272057, 161741, 21375, '<td valign="top">Eyes look a little overexposed.</td>', 'Eyes look a little overexposed.', '2005-04-05 09:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272058, 163049, 21375, '<td valign="top">Gives me shivers.  But good detail and use of color of the rope.</td>', 'Gives me shivers.  But good detail and use of color of the rope.', '2005-04-05 09:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272059, 162754, 21375, '<td valign="top">blurry</td>', 'blurry', '2005-04-05 09:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272060, 161996, 21375, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh.  Great photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Made me laugh.  Great photo.  Well done.', '2005-04-05 09:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272061, 162918, 21375, '<td valign="top">Good.  Grass and kitty are in good detail.</td>', 'Good.  Grass and kitty are in good detail.', '2005-04-05 09:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272062, 163084, 21375, '<td valign="top">Great shot... title is great too.  Truly a Diva</td>', 'Great shot... title is great too.  Truly a Diva', '2005-04-05 09:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272063, 161682, 21375, '<td valign="top">Looks like an oil painting to be placed above a favorite fireplace.  Great job.</td>', 'Looks like an oil painting to be placed above a favorite fireplace.  Great job.', '2005-04-05 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272071, 161146, 35122, '<td valign="top">those two just look like a handful...beautiful....</td>', 'those two just look like a handful...beautiful....', '2005-04-05 09:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272078, 162476, 29797, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition here. Nice use of negative space and balance of color. I like the fact that you cropped his ear and not tryed to fit everything in, it keeps the negative space where it should be. Good emotion and cute dog too.</td>', 'I really like your composition here. Nice use of negative space and balance of color. I like the fact that you cropped his ear and not tryed to fit everything in, it keeps the negative space where it should be. Good emotion and cute dog too.', '2005-04-05 09:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272095, 162678, 29797, '<td valign="top">A very disciplined bunny, or a glutton for punishment. If I could read his thoughts he''d be saying "Just take the damn picture already!" Cute!</td>', 'A very disciplined bunny, or a glutton for punishment. If I could read his thoughts he''d be saying "Just take the damn picture already!" Cute!', '2005-04-05 09:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272101, 162559, 29797, '<td valign="top">Sharp picture, but I would try to keep the focus more on those beautiful eyes than the nose. Easier said than done with animals though.</td>', 'Sharp picture, but I would try to keep the focus more on those beautiful eyes than the nose. Easier said than done with animals though.', '2005-04-05 09:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272105, 161420, 29797, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp where it should be.</td>', 'Nice and sharp where it should be.', '2005-04-05 09:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272113, 162270, 15711, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the essence of the dog.  Excellent!</td>', 'You''ve captured the essence of the dog.  Excellent!', '2005-04-05 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272176, 161175, 31443, '<td valign="top">Cutie!</td>', 'Cutie!', '2005-04-05 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272180, 162686, 31443, '<td valign="top">Black kitties don''t photograph well do they! Wish you didn''t use the flash, some backlighting would have done the job..</td>', 'Black kitties don''t photograph well do they! Wish you didn''t use the flash, some backlighting would have done the job..', '2005-04-05 10:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272182, 162785, 31443, '<td valign="top">They do but I would have liked to see more of the kitty...</td>', 'They do but I would have liked to see more of the kitty...', '2005-04-05 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272184, 162229, 31443, '<td valign="top">And I can believe that!</td>', 'And I can believe that!', '2005-04-05 10:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272186, 162940, 31443, '<td valign="top">Sweet dog...</td>', 'Sweet dog...', '2005-04-05 10:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272191, 161791, 31443, '<td valign="top">What big eyes you have!!! Very sweet...</td>', 'What big eyes you have!!! Very sweet...', '2005-04-05 10:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272196, 162819, 6668, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot, though to me this is much more of a candid moment shot than a portrait really, still very nice though.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot, though to me this is much more of a candid moment shot than a portrait really, still very nice though.', '2005-04-05 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272204, 161031, 31443, '<td valign="top">Oh, aren''t they always??</td>', 'Oh, aren''t they always??', '2005-04-05 11:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
