(1272248, 162754, 29203, '<td valign="top">sooo sweet<br/></td>', 'sooo sweet', '2005-04-05 11:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272252, 162981, 31443, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t look very happy :(</td>', 'He doesn''t look very happy :(', '2005-04-05 11:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272261, 162526, 31443, '<td valign="top">Extra hugs and scritches from me :)</td>', 'Extra hugs and scritches from me :)', '2005-04-05 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272263, 161617, 31443, '<td valign="top">And all eyes he is! Pity about the angle........</td>', 'And all eyes he is! Pity about the angle........', '2005-04-05 11:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272267, 161617, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - Cute kitty!!!  About your photo - the resolution looks very low... the picture is very pixellated.  Definately need more lighting on Jacob... a silver or gold reflector looks best for dark animals (staple aluminum foil to a board works just as well)... it''ll bring out the highlights on his fur without over-exposing yoru photo.  I do like the angle you took the photo... I think lighting and resolution are the only improvements that could be made.  =)</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - Cute kitty!!!  About your photo - the resolution looks very low... the picture is very pixellated.  Definately need more lighting on Jacob... a silver or gold reflector looks best for dark animals (staple aluminum foil to a board works just as well)... it''ll bring out the highlights on his fur without over-exposing yoru photo.  I do like the angle you took the photo... I think lighting and resolution are the only improvements that could be made.  =)', '2005-04-05 11:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272270, 161615, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - I really wish the photo was larger... if are unsure how to do this for the contests you can PM me afterwards.  I really love your idea!  I would like to see some highlights on kitty.  Otherwise, great composition and idea!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - I really wish the photo was larger... if are unsure how to do this for the contests you can PM me afterwards.  I really love your idea!  I would like to see some highlights on kitty.  Otherwise, great composition and idea!', '2005-04-05 11:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272272, 162741, 31443, '<td valign="top">A Russian Blue named Tigger? Cute face....</td>', 'A Russian Blue named Tigger? Cute face....', '2005-04-05 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272274, 163010, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - For some reason it almost looks like the dogs were cut out and placed on the black background.  Maybe too much post-processing? I think the composition would look better if you did not crop of the paw and tail of the dog on the left.  The photo also needs some highlights - looks overall very grey.  Otherwise, I really like your idea and think it is a cute photo!  (and cute pups!!!)</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - For some reason it almost looks like the dogs were cut out and placed on the black background.  Maybe too much post-processing? I think the composition would look better if you did not crop of the paw and tail of the dog on the left.  The photo also needs some highlights - looks overall very grey.  Otherwise, I really like your idea and think it is a cute photo!  (and cute pups!!!)', '2005-04-05 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272277, 161582, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - Awh... what a cutie!  I think we can all relate to getting "the look" from our dogs  =) haha.  I think your pup''s eye was dodged too much... it looks too light and the contrast is really low on it (the pupil shoudl be black.  I think that is very distracting since the eyes are normally the focus of a portrait... people tend to look at the eyes first.  Otherwise, I really like your idea for the contest and I think you overall did really good  =)</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - Awh... what a cutie!  I think we can all relate to getting "the look" from our dogs  =) haha.  I think your pup''s eye was dodged too much... it looks too light and the contrast is really low on it (the pupil shoudl be black.  I think that is very distracting since the eyes are normally the focus of a portrait... people tend to look at the eyes first.  Otherwise, I really like your idea for the contest and I think you overall did really good  =)', '2005-04-05 11:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272280, 162713, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) - What a beautiful cat!!!  I think the only thing that will hurt your photo in the challenge is that her back legs are cut off... The composition looks really off.  I would have liked to have seen you more to the right and her back legs still in, or more of her body cropped.  It''s a little distracting.  Otherwise, I love the colors, contrast, and it''s very sharp!  Overall, I think you did a really good job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) - What a beautiful cat!!!  I think the only thing that will hurt your photo in the challenge is that her back legs are cut off... The composition looks really off.  I would have liked to have seen you more to the right and her back legs still in, or more of her body cropped.  It''s a little distracting.  Otherwise, I love the colors, contrast, and it''s very sharp!  Overall, I think you did a really good job!', '2005-04-05 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272282, 161682, 31443, '<td valign="top">This looks like a photo of a painting!!!!</td>', 'This looks like a photo of a painting!!!!', '2005-04-05 11:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272287, 161867, 32732, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOODNESS!  what a gorgess little puppy!</td>', 'OH MY GOODNESS!  what a gorgess little puppy!', '2005-04-05 11:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
