(1272314, 161869, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog, lighting and focus. I think a more careful crop would of raised the score (at least from me). You did a good job of capturing this handsome dogs personality and expression.</td>', 'Beautiful dog, lighting and focus. I think a more careful crop would of raised the score (at least from me). You did a good job of capturing this handsome dogs personality and expression.', '2005-04-05 12:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272315, 163081, 26045, '<td valign="top">I saw your forum post before it was removed (?) so I wanted to say that 1. I got the S in Pets, but thought it cheezy and 2. No, the collar on the girl is not noticeable. Also, the photo is blah, no pop, no contrast, very dull. Which is why I scored it low.</td>', 'I saw your forum post before it was removed (?) so I wanted to say that 1. I got the S in Pets, but thought it cheezy and 2. No, the collar on the girl is not noticeable. Also, the photo is blah, no pop, no contrast, very dull. Which is why I scored it low.', '2005-04-05 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272318, 162251, 327, '<td valign="top">This face (eyes) could melt a heart of ston. Love the lighting. Congrats.</td>', 'This face (eyes) could melt a heart of ston. Love the lighting. Congrats.', '2005-04-05 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
