(1272325, 162820, 31738, '<td valign="top">There''s my little girl!! My beautiful little girl. She looks so adorable!! I love the expression on her face!!</td>', 'There''s my little girl!! My beautiful little girl. She looks so adorable!! I love the expression on her face!!', '2005-04-05 12:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
