(1272329, 162570, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes, very cute and a sweet shot. I do find it a bit dark and I think the lack of light is making the color look a little off in a few places. I also admit it may just be my monitor so take my comment  for what it''s worth. :) All the best.</td>', 'Yes, very cute and a sweet shot. I do find it a bit dark and I think the lack of light is making the color look a little off in a few places. I also admit it may just be my monitor so take my comment  for what it''s worth. :) All the best.', '2005-04-05 12:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272331, 162863, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great shot of Peanut Laurie. Love the pink frock.Your dof pulls the eye right to her smile and those deep eyes. Great color and lighting. This portrait will look great on the family wall. Good luck!</td>', 'Great shot of Peanut Laurie. Love the pink frock.Your dof pulls the eye right to her smile and those deep eyes. Great color and lighting. This portrait will look great on the family wall. Good luck!', '2005-04-05 12:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272333, 162959, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe it was compression..? Or somthing else like your position when shooting. The far leftside looks a bit crushed? Just my 2 cents. Good luck.</td>', 'Maybe it was compression..? Or somthing else like your position when shooting. The far leftside looks a bit crushed? Just my 2 cents. Good luck.', '2005-04-05 12:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272336, 162812, 327, '<td valign="top">Very popular dog these days, even on in the White House. I would of like to see his/her face from the front to include the eyes.</td>', 'Very popular dog these days, even on in the White House. I would of like to see his/her face from the front to include the eyes.', '2005-04-05 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
