(1272463, 162559, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Bikkie is a Cutie!  I would only suggest next time focuisng on his eyes... in pet portraits people tend to focus their cameras on the nose instead of eyes, however, when people look at the portrait their attention goes to straight to the eyes first.  If the eyes are out of focus then the portrait doesn''t look right.  Otherwise, great job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Bikkie is a Cutie!  I would only suggest next time focuisng on his eyes... in pet portraits people tend to focus their cameras on the nose instead of eyes, however, when people look at the portrait their attention goes to straight to the eyes first.  If the eyes are out of focus then the portrait doesn''t look right.  Otherwise, great job!', '2005-04-05 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272465, 163018, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Very beautiful!  I love the b7w... excellent contrast and good composition.</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Very beautiful!  I love the b7w... excellent contrast and good composition.', '2005-04-05 13:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272466, 162819, 29477, '<td valign="top">I was quickly scannig the images before voting and this made me say WOW...Beautiful composition and capture.  if I had to critique it would be dog being out of focus, but nonetheless, still a great shot.  Good Luck</td>', 'I was quickly scannig the images before voting and this made me say WOW...Beautiful composition and capture.  if I had to critique it would be dog being out of focus, but nonetheless, still a great shot.  Good Luck', '2005-04-05 13:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272480, 162577, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Great idea for the challenge!  Very minor, but I would have cloned that piece of hair on his paw pad... doesn''t effect your score =)  I would also have burned in the white area between the paws and your pupr''s head... it''s really distracting and takes away from your pups'' face.  Other than that, excellent job!!!  I really love it!</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Great idea for the challenge!  Very minor, but I would have cloned that piece of hair on his paw pad... doesn''t effect your score =)  I would also have burned in the white area between the paws and your pupr''s head... it''s really distracting and takes away from your pups'' face.  Other than that, excellent job!!!  I really love it!', '2005-04-05 13:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272484, 162690, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Very nice portrait!!!  I am not sure if this is a studio set-up, in case it is I would recommend either a gold or silver reflect on the left side... this will add some hilghlights in his/her eye and bring out detail in the fur.  It''s so difficult photographing black pets... especially with so much white... you did an excellent job!!!</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Very nice portrait!!!  I am not sure if this is a studio set-up, in case it is I would recommend either a gold or silver reflect on the left side... this will add some hilghlights in his/her eye and bring out detail in the fur.  It''s so difficult photographing black pets... especially with so much white... you did an excellent job!!!', '2005-04-05 13:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272489, 163087, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - I think he''s been guarding his owner for too long now  =) haha.  Excellent lighting!!!  I am not crazy about snakes or skulls, but I do love the quality of this photograph and the composition.  Excellent job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - I think he''s been guarding his owner for too long now  =) haha.  Excellent lighting!!!  I am not crazy about snakes or skulls, but I do love the quality of this photograph and the composition.  Excellent job!', '2005-04-05 13:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272491, 160715, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Awh... and what a beautiful Rose!  =)  It may be a monitor calibration issue, but the photograph looks an overall dull tone.  I would like to see some contrast (dark darks and light whites).  In addition, I think she''s cropped a little too tightly.  However, overall I think you did a good job  =)  Very nice portrait!</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Awh... and what a beautiful Rose!  =)  It may be a monitor calibration issue, but the photograph looks an overall dull tone.  I would like to see some contrast (dark darks and light whites).  In addition, I think she''s cropped a little too tightly.  However, overall I think you did a good job  =)  Very nice portrait!', '2005-04-05 14:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1272495, 161076, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - Awh... very cute!  I would only suggest cropping it so it doesn''t look like Murphie''s about to slide down hill  =)  I would have also left a little more space to the left and possibly the top.  However, overall I think you did a really great job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - Awh... very cute!  I would only suggest cropping it so it doesn''t look like Murphie''s about to slide down hill  =)  I would have also left a little more space to the left and possibly the top.  However, overall I think you did a really great job!', '2005-04-05 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
