(1273077, 163089, 27847, '<td valign="top">What a happy pup!  I love everything about this picture...the "smiling" face, the tones &amp; the green contrast of the background.  Well done!</td>', 'What a happy pup!  I love everything about this picture...the "smiling" face, the tones & the green contrast of the background.  Well done!', '2005-04-05 21:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273086, 163077, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very colourful &amp; nice DOF.  Nice crispness with lots of detail in the feathers.  I just wish the bird had been facing a little more towards the camera, but I know how hard it is to get a decent shot of any animal.  Very well done!   8</td>', 'Very colourful & nice DOF.  Nice crispness with lots of detail in the feathers.  I just wish the bird had been facing a little more towards the camera, but I know how hard it is to get a decent shot of any animal.  Very well done!   8', '2005-04-05 21:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273094, 163080, 9111, '<td valign="top">cute puppy,  try to get his attention next time to get more of his face towards you.  I like how sharp his face is and the basket hes in.  VERY good job !!</td>', 'cute puppy,  try to get his attention next time to get more of his face towards you.  I like how sharp his face is and the basket hes in.  VERY good job !!', '2005-04-05 21:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273095, 162421, 27847, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot...maybe it''s the cat''s expression, or perhaps the sharp contrast of the red background.  It''s cropped a little too tight on the left, IMO.  Good work!</td>', 'I like this shot a lot...maybe it''s the cat''s expression, or perhaps the sharp contrast of the red background.  It''s cropped a little too tight on the left, IMO.  Good work!', '2005-04-05 21:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
