(1273145, 161869, 31214, '<td valign="top">You can''t go wrong with a German Shepherd Dog!  Jake is very photogenic.  I would bump the saturation just a tad to bring out her color.  8</td>', 'You can''t go wrong with a German Shepherd Dog!  Jake is very photogenic.  I would bump the saturation just a tad to bring out her color.  8', '2005-04-05 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273146, 162971, 31214, '<td valign="top">I never thought I would be giving a snake picture such a high score.  Great composition and super clarity.</td>', 'I never thought I would be giving a snake picture such a high score.  Great composition and super clarity.', '2005-04-05 22:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273149, 163032, 31214, '<td valign="top">Great composition, great detail and DOF.  I would recommend touching up the red in that handsome boy''s eye.  Great looking dog.....well done!</td>', 'Great composition, great detail and DOF.  I would recommend touching up the red in that handsome boy''s eye.  Great looking dog.....well done!', '2005-04-05 22:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273150, 162995, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very clean shot.  I like the pose too.  The border works too!  Great job!</td>', 'Very clean shot.  I like the pose too.  The border works too!  Great job!', '2005-04-05 22:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273153, 163053, 31214, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I love the bottom teeth.  You certainly captured a unique expression!  Nice clean background and good lighting.  nice job!</td>', 'Great image.  I love the bottom teeth.  You certainly captured a unique expression!  Nice clean background and good lighting.  nice job!', '2005-04-05 22:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273154, 162674, 31214, '<td valign="top">I really love the softness of this photo.  Great job and a beautiful cat!</td>', 'I really love the softness of this photo.  Great job and a beautiful cat!', '2005-04-05 22:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273157, 162427, 31214, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Great color.  I like the texture....you can almost "feel" him.  Great portrait!</td>', 'Love this shot.  Great color.  I like the texture....you can almost "feel" him.  Great portrait!', '2005-04-05 22:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273160, 161682, 31214, '<td valign="top">Wow...I can tell you are a master at this.  Your beautiful dogs blend right into the painting.  This should be hanging in your livingroom!  Bumping up</td>', 'Wow...I can tell you are a master at this.  Your beautiful dogs blend right into the painting.  This should be hanging in your livingroom!  Bumping up', '2005-04-05 22:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273161, 162997, 31214, '<td valign="top">Your tired old friend is beautiful and looks like a sweet companion.  Nice sharp picture.  I might suggest seeing a bit of a profile too.  Great job.</td>', 'Your tired old friend is beautiful and looks like a sweet companion.  Nice sharp picture.  I might suggest seeing a bit of a profile too.  Great job.', '2005-04-05 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273164, 163090, 31214, '<td valign="top">Great job with a tough subject (black dog).  Looks like you turned up the contrast or USM .  My suggestion would be to mask the background when you do that so you only accentuate the detail in the dog and not the background.  Anyway, you''ve captured a great look on a beautiful dog!</td>', 'Great job with a tough subject (black dog).  Looks like you turned up the contrast or USM .  My suggestion would be to mask the background when you do that so you only accentuate the detail in the dog and not the background.  Anyway, you''ve captured a great look on a beautiful dog!', '2005-04-05 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273255, 163055, 12448, '<td valign="top">Taking my second run through and trying to comment as I go.  I love this shot, the look, the composition, the choice to use b&amp;w.   There is something about the shot that bugs me though and I can''t quite figure it out.  A 9 for now but I''ll probably be back to figure out what my bug is ;)</td>', 'Taking my second run through and trying to comment as I go.  I love this shot, the look, the composition, the choice to use b&w.   There is something about the shot that bugs me though and I can''t quite figure it out.  A 9 for now but I''ll probably be back to figure out what my bug is ;)', '2005-04-05 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273256, 162863, 12448, '<td valign="top">OMG, so cute!  I love this shot but the pink is a bit much for me, almost overpowers the poor baby!  I also have a small dog, weighs out at 3 pounds on a good day, LOL!  A 9</td>', 'OMG, so cute!  I love this shot but the pink is a bit much for me, almost overpowers the poor baby!  I also have a small dog, weighs out at 3 pounds on a good day, LOL!  A 9', '2005-04-06 00:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273257, 161498, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, that look, the look that says, "Love me!  You just have to!"  Very nice, good lighting, very nice composition, the only thing that bothers me is the edging, I''m not a big fan of this type of edging.  So I hope a 9 is okay :)</td>', 'Oh, that look, the look that says, "Love me!  You just have to!"  Very nice, good lighting, very nice composition, the only thing that bothers me is the edging, I''m not a big fan of this type of edging.  So I hope a 9 is okay :)', '2005-04-06 00:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273259, 162897, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, Maya is beautiful!  The change to sepia is a good choice, just seems a tad too yellowish, just a very little tad.  A 9</td>', 'Oh, Maya is beautiful!  The change to sepia is a good choice, just seems a tad too yellowish, just a very little tad.  A 9', '2005-04-06 00:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273261, 162785, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love these types of shots, so intense yet so sweet.  I like the overall composition and feel of the shot, the window frame or curtain is the back is a bit of a distraction though.   A 9</td>', 'I love these types of shots, so intense yet so sweet.  I like the overall composition and feel of the shot, the window frame or curtain is the back is a bit of a distraction though.   A 9', '2005-04-06 00:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273263, 162664, 12448, '<td valign="top">And they certainly are serious about that, aren''t they?<br/> <br/>Nice shot, good setting, seems a little crooked though, like the cat is about to slide out the left side of the shot and could use just a touch more contrast, just a touch.  A 9</td>', 'And they certainly are serious about that, aren''t they? Nice shot, good setting, seems a little crooked though, like the cat is about to slide out the left side of the shot and could use just a touch more contrast, just a touch.  A 9', '2005-04-06 00:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273265, 163043, 12448, '<td valign="top">Louise is beautiful.  Very nice, if not for the hot spot on her nose this would rate a 10, as is, a 9</td>', 'Louise is beautiful.  Very nice, if not for the hot spot on her nose this would rate a 10, as is, a 9', '2005-04-06 00:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273266, 162610, 12448, '<td valign="top">Kobi is beautiful and I bet very protective, LOL!  A wonderful shot, but there seems to be a halo around the ears, a bit of a distraction.  A 9</td>', 'Kobi is beautiful and I bet very protective, LOL!  A wonderful shot, but there seems to be a halo around the ears, a bit of a distraction.  A 9', '2005-04-06 00:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273267, 162421, 12448, '<td valign="top">I bet they do!  Nice shot, good composition to me, but the one ear just getting cut off is a bit off to me and the background is a bit overpowering.  A 9</td>', 'I bet they do!  Nice shot, good composition to me, but the one ear just getting cut off is a bit off to me and the background is a bit overpowering.  A 9', '2005-04-06 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1273269, 162690, 12448, '<td valign="top">Such intense eyes.  Just what were they watching?  Nice shot, I''m guessing you either used a gaussian blur and then cleared the eyes up or you have a very, very shallow DOF.  I would like to have seen the whole face in focus at least.  A 9</td>', 'Such intense eyes.  Just what were they watching?  Nice shot, I''m guessing you either used a gaussian blur and then cleared the eyes up or you have a very, very shallow DOF.  I would like to have seen the whole face in focus at least.  A 9', '2005-04-06 00:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273274, 161156, 12448, '<td valign="top">Spaz?  Are you sure?  Looks so calm! :)  I like the shot, good composition overall but seems just a bit off, not sure if it should be just a little smaller to bring the cat''s ears to the edge, therefore taking you in one side and out the other?  A 9</td>', 'Spaz?  Are you sure?  Looks so calm! :)  I like the shot, good composition overall but seems just a bit off, not sure if it should be just a little smaller to bring the cat''s ears to the edge, therefore taking you in one side and out the other?  A 9', '2005-04-06 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273276, 162623, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh I bet he/she is!  What a cutie!  My only complaint is I can''t see the eyes better and I know it can be a problem with the yorkie/terrier breed as I have one but it is possible.  As is a 9</td>', 'Oh I bet he/she is!  What a cutie!  My only complaint is I can''t see the eyes better and I know it can be a problem with the yorkie/terrier breed as I have one but it is possible.  As is a 9', '2005-04-06 00:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273292, 163087, 6668, '<td valign="top">OK, I hate snakes more than anything you can imagine, but yet even I like this shot, very nicely done, love the lighting, only thing I wish the snake was looking a tad more this way.  Nice work. 8</td>', 'OK, I hate snakes more than anything you can imagine, but yet even I like this shot, very nicely done, love the lighting, only thing I wish the snake was looking a tad more this way.  Nice work. 8', '2005-04-06 00:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273296, 162766, 8624, '<td valign="top">I wish you had either cropped closer or included the one on the left (Stanly?) completely.</td>', 'I wish you had either cropped closer or included the one on the left (Stanly?) completely.', '2005-04-06 00:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273303, 161963, 8624, '<td valign="top">the watch. thumb and T shirt are all unfortunate distractions that detract from your otherwise interesting lizard.</td>', 'the watch. thumb and T shirt are all unfortunate distractions that detract from your otherwise interesting lizard.', '2005-04-06 00:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
