(1278309, 162559, 12448, '<td valign="top">BIKKIE!  Cute name, adorable dog!  Love the colors, the light the everything, just about.  One tiny, little nitpick thing, the background, instead of complimenting the dog seems to fight for attention, just a little too bright.  But otherwise, if the DOF had extended to the eyes so they were also in sharp focus this would be close to perfection.  As is, a 9, I''m sorry.</td>', 'BIKKIE!  Cute name, adorable dog!  Love the colors, the light the everything, just about.  One tiny, little nitpick thing, the background, instead of complimenting the dog seems to fight for attention, just a little too bright.  But otherwise, if the DOF had extended to the eyes so they were also in sharp focus this would be close to perfection.  As is, a 9, I''m sorry.', '2005-04-07 23:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278311, 161417, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, she''s a pretty girl, a very pretty girl!  I love Macaws adn this one is no exception.  This is a great shot, I like the fact that you can''t see very single little detail in the feathers and the colors and composition is wonderful to me. My only complaint about the shot is the hot spot on the back of the head, just a tad too much light.  A 9</td>', 'Oh, she''s a pretty girl, a very pretty girl!  I love Macaws adn this one is no exception.  This is a great shot, I like the fact that you can''t see very single little detail in the feathers and the colors and composition is wonderful to me. My only complaint about the shot is the hot spot on the back of the head, just a tad too much light.  A 9', '2005-04-07 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278313, 163049, 12448, '<td valign="top">Pretty!  So Pretty!  Very nicely done, the snake coming out, the bottle hanging there.  The only thing that kept this from being a 10 is where the snake''s head is positioned, it if was either on top fo the body or on the right side this would be perfection.  The light is wonderful, the composition is devine and the lighting is perfect.  But because of that darn placement of the head, a 9</td>', 'Pretty!  So Pretty!  Very nicely done, the snake coming out, the bottle hanging there.  The only thing that kept this from being a 10 is where the snake''s head is positioned, it if was either on top fo the body or on the right side this would be perfection.  The light is wonderful, the composition is devine and the lighting is perfect.  But because of that darn placement of the head, a 9', '2005-04-07 23:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278314, 162662, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ooooooooooo, poor baby!  So cute!  I really like this shot, the tone, the composition, the look on the dog''s face.  The only nitpick I have is the hot spot on top of the head and if the dog was looking more at the camera it would be perfect.  as is a 9</td>', 'Ooooooooooo, poor baby!  So cute!  I really like this shot, the tone, the composition, the look on the dog''s face.  The only nitpick I have is the hot spot on top of the head and if the dog was looking more at the camera it would be perfect.  as is a 9', '2005-04-07 23:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278317, 162475, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oooooooooooh, so cute!  How on earth did you get the dog to sit still?  I know the collie breeds are imfamous for MOVING all the time, LOL!  A very well done shot overall, I like the bit of ripple in the cloth under the dog''s ear area there and the DOF is very well done.  My only complaints are the tip of the ear (basically the hair) on the top being cut off and just a tad too much space on the right for this crop.  If you had come in a little bit more on one side or the other it would seem more balanced to me.  A 9</td>', 'Oooooooooooh, so cute!  How on earth did you get the dog to sit still?  I know the collie breeds are imfamous for MOVING all the time, LOL!  A very well done shot overall, I like the bit of ripple in the cloth under the dog''s ear area there and the DOF is very well done.  My only complaints are the tip of the ear (basically the hair) on the top being cut off and just a tad too much space on the right for this crop.  If you had come in a little bit more on one side or the other it would seem more balanced to me.  A 9', '2005-04-07 23:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278320, 162818, 12448, '<td valign="top">Tyger is beautiful and that unique nose!  How cute!  I love this shot, the only thing that bothers me it the way the hair seems to disappear on the body, I''m guessing Tyger to shaved for the summer or because of matts?  More focus on the face or cropping to just the face would have made this one a 10 for me, as is a 9</td>', 'Tyger is beautiful and that unique nose!  How cute!  I love this shot, the only thing that bothers me it the way the hair seems to disappear on the body, I''m guessing Tyger to shaved for the summer or because of matts?  More focus on the face or cropping to just the face would have made this one a 10 for me, as is a 9', '2005-04-07 23:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278325, 163018, 12448, '<td valign="top">What expressive eyes you have my dear!  So beautiful!  This is a very well composition shot, very balanced and the coloration is wonderfu.  The only thing that bothers me is the picture above the cat''s head.  If it was just the cat and the vase it would really focus me on the cat adn the vase would lead me out of the shot.  As it is, the picture is competing with both the cat and the vase.  A 9</td>', 'What expressive eyes you have my dear!  So beautiful!  This is a very well composition shot, very balanced and the coloration is wonderfu.  The only thing that bothers me is the picture above the cat''s head.  If it was just the cat and the vase it would really focus me on the cat adn the vase would lead me out of the shot.  As it is, the picture is competing with both the cat and the vase.  A 9', '2005-04-07 23:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278327, 162769, 12448, '<td valign="top">Puka has his claws out and ready to go, LOL!  This is a great shot, the feel, the eyes, the composition. Only two tiny things that kept it from being perfect for me, the really close crop on the one foo, would have liked to see a little red on the bottom there and the shadow on the left eye, the highlights are wonderful but that shadow bothers me for some odd reason.  As is a 9</td>', 'Puka has his claws out and ready to go, LOL!  This is a great shot, the feel, the eyes, the composition. Only two tiny things that kept it from being perfect for me, the really close crop on the one foo, would have liked to see a little red on the bottom there and the shadow on the left eye, the highlights are wonderful but that shadow bothers me for some odd reason.  As is a 9', '2005-04-07 23:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278330, 162027, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, so cute!  The expression is priceless and the way the cat is set up is very cute.  The choice of black and white is very nice, but I wonder what it would look like in color because with the B&amp;W the cat almost blends into the background, a little hard to define.  A 9</td>', 'Hahaha, so cute!  The expression is priceless and the way the cat is set up is very cute.  The choice of black and white is very nice, but I wonder what it would look like in color because with the B&W the cat almost blends into the background, a little hard to define.  A 9', '2005-04-08 00:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278391, 161788, 18367, '<td valign="top">This is one incredibly good photo.  How you ever managed to get that beautiful working dog to pose for you like that is beyond belief.  The image is clear, crips and a definite eye grabber.  THe collar and the NEADS logo are two other factors which draw your eyes to this beautiful animal.<br/> <br/>Since I know what NEADS stands for,  I have a good idea who took this picture, but that will not detract me from giving you a well deserved 10    :0)  hehehehe.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is one incredibly good photo.  How you ever managed to get that beautiful working dog to pose for you like that is beyond belief.  The image is clear, crips and a definite eye grabber.  THe collar and the NEADS logo are two other factors which draw your eyes to this beautiful animal. Since I know what NEADS stands for,  I have a good idea who took this picture, but that will not detract me from giving you a well deserved 10    :0)  hehehehe.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2005-04-08 00:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278405, 163087, 18367, '<td valign="top">Astounding... I am keeping a safe distance for fear it will strike.  Wonderful background, fantastic use of a prop, and  a truly wonderful photo.  I have nothing but laudable comments for your submission, as it is truly a work of art.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge.... you should do very well</td>', 'Astounding... I am keeping a safe distance for fear it will strike.  Wonderful background, fantastic use of a prop, and  a truly wonderful photo.  I have nothing but laudable comments for your submission, as it is truly a work of art. Good luck with the challenge.... you should do very well', '2005-04-08 00:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
