(1278420, 162966, 18367, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed and one of my favorites.  This photo is one of the four highest ranking photos in my opinion and I truly hope the remainder of the voters think so too.  The pose and the expression on the cat''s face are truly priceless and your ability to capture this moment in such a clear manner warrants the very high score, which I have given you.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Very nice indeed and one of my favorites.  This photo is one of the four highest ranking photos in my opinion and I truly hope the remainder of the voters think so too.  The pose and the expression on the cat''s face are truly priceless and your ability to capture this moment in such a clear manner warrants the very high score, which I have given you. Good luck', '2005-04-08 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278421, 163077, 36150, '<td valign="top">Vivid colors, beautiful detail. However, I think it could have been a bit sharper and the composition could be a little better (maybe if the bird wasn''t dead centered), but besides that, looks very nice.</td>', 'Vivid colors, beautiful detail. However, I think it could have been a bit sharper and the composition could be a little better (maybe if the bird wasn''t dead centered), but besides that, looks very nice.', '2005-04-08 00:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278423, 162862, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ha, cute.  But not really a portrait shot, more a candid moment.  Also the picture lacks any real pop factor, the colors look really flat and dull, unlike the dog I''m sure!  An adjustment in levels and/or curves might really help make this shot stand out more.  A 4</td>', 'Ha, cute.  But not really a portrait shot, more a candid moment.  Also the picture lacks any real pop factor, the colors look really flat and dull, unlike the dog I''m sure!  An adjustment in levels and/or curves might really help make this shot stand out more.  A 4', '2005-04-08 00:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278426, 161996, 18349, '<td valign="top">Such an expressive doggie!  Is that a whippet?  Adorable!!!!  Love the pose.  Wish the light was a bit more even on the left side, but still very well done.  Clarity and sharpness are wonderful.  :o)</td>', 'Such an expressive doggie!  Is that a whippet?  Adorable!!!!  Love the pose.  Wish the light was a bit more even on the left side, but still very well done.  Clarity and sharpness are wonderful.  :o)', '2005-04-08 00:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278427, 163100, 12448, '<td valign="top">Let''s see, rubber duck as a pet......... hummmmmmmmmmm, really stretching!  A very nice portrait mind you but still stretching it as I''m sure you''ve heard or will hear a million times.<br/> <br/>Not a bad shot overall but the white seems a bit dull to me (yes my monitor is calibrated), almost has a pink hue to it and no, I''m not wearing a pink or red shirt (I''m teasing you because I figure if you entered this you must have a great sense of humor) :)<br/> <br/>A 4, sorry</td>', 'Let''s see, rubber duck as a pet......... hummmmmmmmmmm, really stretching!  A very nice portrait mind you but still stretching it as I''m sure you''ve heard or will hear a million times. Not a bad shot overall but the white seems a bit dull to me (yes my monitor is calibrated), almost has a pink hue to it and no, I''m not wearing a pink or red shirt (I''m teasing you because I figure if you entered this you must have a great sense of humor) :) A 4, sorry', '2005-04-08 00:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
