(1278441, 162994, 12448, '<td valign="top">Great capture, hope he caught it after all that work!  Nice snapshot but not really a portrait and while the eyes have a great expression, the ball ends up being more a distraction then really adding to the shot for me.  The blur on his body is expected in an action shot like this but the mouth threw me just a bit.  If it all could have been in focus (the face area that is) this would be a great addition to your scrapbook of memories.  A 4</td>', 'Great capture, hope he caught it after all that work!  Nice snapshot but not really a portrait and while the eyes have a great expression, the ball ends up being more a distraction then really adding to the shot for me.  The blur on his body is expected in an action shot like this but the mouth threw me just a bit.  If it all could have been in focus (the face area that is) this would be a great addition to your scrapbook of memories.  A 4', '2005-04-08 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278443, 161615, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is just too small to judge properly.</td>', 'This is just too small to judge properly.', '2005-04-08 00:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278448, 163094, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cute, very cute indeed.  Looking at the shot on the monitor I''m guessing you went for humor instead of portraiture. :)  The lighting seems very dull and the composition seems a bit loose, too many things fighting for my attention when it should be centered on the dog.  And the border does nothing for this shot but overpower it and make the lighting seem even duller.  A 4</td>', 'Very cute, very cute indeed.  Looking at the shot on the monitor I''m guessing you went for humor instead of portraiture. :)  The lighting seems very dull and the composition seems a bit loose, too many things fighting for my attention when it should be centered on the dog.  And the border does nothing for this shot but overpower it and make the lighting seem even duller.  A 4', '2005-04-08 00:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278452, 162807, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ha, I love the tag on the collar.  Very cute.  A nice shot but the lack of overall sharpness or focus bothers me and the conversion to black and white leaves the cat blending into the background instead of standing out from it.  A 4</td>', 'Ha, I love the tag on the collar.  Very cute.  A nice shot but the lack of overall sharpness or focus bothers me and the conversion to black and white leaves the cat blending into the background instead of standing out from it.  A 4', '2005-04-08 00:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278455, 162275, 25464, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very poor quality image.  Maybe taken way to small with too little light.  The wrinkled cloth background is a definite problem as well.</td>', 'This looks like a very poor quality image.  Maybe taken way to small with too little light.  The wrinkled cloth background is a definite problem as well.', '2005-04-08 00:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278456, 162977, 12448, '<td valign="top">Aw, such a sweet face!  Nice candid snapshot but not really the portrait type per say.  Good expression on the dog''s face, nice capture but the items on the left seem very distracting and fighting for my attention.  A tighter crop would really bring to dog to the viewer''s attention.  A 5</td>', 'Aw, such a sweet face!  Nice candid snapshot but not really the portrait type per say.  Good expression on the dog''s face, nice capture but the items on the left seem very distracting and fighting for my attention.  A tighter crop would really bring to dog to the viewer''s attention.  A 5', '2005-04-08 00:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278470, 161617, 12448, '<td valign="top">Jacob is adorable from what I can see.  The problem with shooting black animals and this I know so well, is getting the details.  It is sooooooo hard.  The focus is also off adn the pictures and cord running through the shot are very distracting.  A 4</td>', 'Jacob is adorable from what I can see.  The problem with shooting black animals and this I know so well, is getting the details.  It is sooooooo hard.  The focus is also off adn the pictures and cord running through the shot are very distracting.  A 4', '2005-04-08 00:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278474, 162979, 25464, '<td valign="top">A little soft, but great title.</td>', 'A little soft, but great title.', '2005-04-08 00:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278475, 161963, 12448, '<td valign="top">Sweet, a little leopard Gecko!  Very nice pets, I loved them when we had them at the pet store I used to work at.  <br/> <br/>But alas, this shot, as I''m sure you''ve heard needs some work.  The flash is overkill on the lighting aspect and the set up needs lots more work.  PUtting the gecko on a more solid backdrop, cloth or something similar, a color that would really bring out their colors and avoid the direct flash if possible.  A full length shot would also be great, I love their fat little tails :)  A 4</td>', 'Sweet, a little leopard Gecko!  Very nice pets, I loved them when we had them at the pet store I used to work at.   But alas, this shot, as I''m sure you''ve heard needs some work.  The flash is overkill on the lighting aspect and the set up needs lots more work.  PUtting the gecko on a more solid backdrop, cloth or something similar, a color that would really bring out their colors and avoid the direct flash if possible.  A full length shot would also be great, I love their fat little tails :)  A 4', '2005-04-08 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278476, 161837, 31637, '<td valign="top">awesome!</td>', 'awesome!', '2005-04-08 00:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278478, 161065, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice composition but you need some improvement in clarity</td>', 'nice composition but you need some improvement in clarity', '2005-04-08 00:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278479, 161663, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at that sharp, noisy grass, that sharp, noisy, yellow grass, oh wait, is there something else there?  Why yes there is, a very handsome dog playing with his/her ball!  Okay, sorry for the teasing, couldn''t help myself, as you can probably guess, I find the grass in this shot completely overpowering and not helpful in any way.  Some adjusting of the colors to turn it green would really help and  a much tighter crop.  The light is a bit harsh and I''m not sure if you actually sharpened it or not, if you did, it''s a bit too much.  A 4</td>', 'Wow, look at that sharp, noisy grass, that sharp, noisy, yellow grass, oh wait, is there something else there?  Why yes there is, a very handsome dog playing with his/her ball!  Okay, sorry for the teasing, couldn''t help myself, as you can probably guess, I find the grass in this shot completely overpowering and not helpful in any way.  Some adjusting of the colors to turn it green would really help and  a much tighter crop.  The light is a bit harsh and I''m not sure if you actually sharpened it or not, if you did, it''s a bit too much.  A 4', '2005-04-08 00:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278480, 162604, 31637, '<td valign="top">wow...i would love to own my own racehorse someday</td>', 'wow...i would love to own my own racehorse someday', '2005-04-08 00:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278481, 163085, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice...looks like im in the water with it</td>', 'nice...looks like im in the water with it', '2005-04-08 01:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278482, 163097, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahahah, very cute.  I have some guard cat chimes on my porch!  Cute idea but not quite what the challenge was about now.  If you had moved the dog to a better location, i.e. not so busy background and got some better lighting this would proabably score a little higher.  As is a 4</td>', 'Hahahah, very cute.  I have some guard cat chimes on my porch!  Cute idea but not quite what the challenge was about now.  If you had moved the dog to a better location, i.e. not so busy background and got some better lighting this would proabably score a little higher.  As is a 4', '2005-04-08 01:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278483, 161480, 25464, '<td valign="top">The crop here is a bit too tight or the DOF a bit too shallow.  I had no idea what I was looking at and had to enlist help to figure it out.  After I discovered the ear, it became a bit clearer.</td>', 'The crop here is a bit too tight or the DOF a bit too shallow.  I had no idea what I was looking at and had to enlist help to figure it out.  After I discovered the ear, it became a bit clearer.', '2005-04-08 01:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278484, 161000, 31637, '<td valign="top">very nice...your lighting isnt right though...could of made this a ribbon winner with some adjustments</td>', 'very nice...your lighting isnt right though...could of made this a ribbon winner with some adjustments', '2005-04-08 01:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278486, 162681, 31637, '<td valign="top">too dark...your lighting isnt right</td>', 'too dark...your lighting isnt right', '2005-04-08 01:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278488, 163109, 31637, '<td valign="top">great clarity...good use of the flash</td>', 'great clarity...good use of the flash', '2005-04-08 01:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278489, 161562, 25464, '<td valign="top">This doggy and jacket had the potential for a great shot.  The background is way too distracting.  It really turns it into a snap shot rather than a portrait.  With a solid background and a bit sharper focus this would be great.</td>', 'This doggy and jacket had the potential for a great shot.  The background is way too distracting.  It really turns it into a snap shot rather than a portrait.  With a solid background and a bit sharper focus this would be great.', '2005-04-08 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278490, 161454, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great angle and composition.</td>', 'Great angle and composition.', '2005-04-08 01:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278491, 163082, 31637, '<td valign="top">awesome!! great shallow DOF...a 10 !</td>', 'awesome!! great shallow DOF...a 10 !', '2005-04-08 01:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278493, 161537, 31637, '<td valign="top">like this a lot  7</td>', 'like this a lot  7', '2005-04-08 01:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278496, 161915, 31637, '<td valign="top">awesome detail  !!!  did you use a flash?  9</td>', 'awesome detail  !!!  did you use a flash?  9', '2005-04-08 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278498, 162145, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great action and DOF.  I think this would be even better with the addition of a border since it looks so painting like.</td>', 'Great action and DOF.  I think this would be even better with the addition of a border since it looks so painting like.', '2005-04-08 01:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278499, 162929, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice effect on the shot but the dog is such a small part of the overall picture it ends up fighting for your attention.  The lack of details on the dog is also a bit of a let down.  A 4</td>', 'Nice effect on the shot but the dog is such a small part of the overall picture it ends up fighting for your attention.  The lack of details on the dog is also a bit of a let down.  A 4', '2005-04-08 01:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278500, 161440, 25464, '<td valign="top">Perfect eyes.  Striking profile.</td>', 'Perfect eyes.  Striking profile.', '2005-04-08 01:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278502, 162674, 31637, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting here..and I love the soft , yet sharp look...nice cat!   8</td>', 'very nice lighting here..and I love the soft , yet sharp look...nice cat!   8', '2005-04-08 01:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278503, 162662, 31637, '<td valign="top">poor pooch...make him happy!</td>', 'poor pooch...make him happy!', '2005-04-08 01:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278504, 163018, 25464, '<td valign="top">If the cat had been closer to the vase, this would be perfect.  As is, I could still see it on a calendar.</td>', 'If the cat had been closer to the vase, this would be perfect.  As is, I could still see it on a calendar.', '2005-04-08 01:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278505, 162737, 12448, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwwwwwww, what a cutie pie!  Love the face!  Now if the focus was there and slightly better lighting this would really have some potential!  As is, started at a 4 but am going to bump to a 5 just for the cuteness factor! :)</td>', 'Awwwwwwwwwwww, what a cutie pie!  Love the face!  Now if the focus was there and slightly better lighting this would really have some potential!  As is, started at a 4 but am going to bump to a 5 just for the cuteness factor! :)', '2005-04-08 01:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278506, 162535, 31637, '<td valign="top">molto bello.</td>', 'molto bello.', '2005-04-08 01:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278507, 162475, 25464, '<td valign="top">great detail.</td>', 'great detail.', '2005-04-08 01:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278509, 161983, 31637, '<td valign="top">hahaha...nice portrait...cool border and composition</td>', 'hahaha...nice portrait...cool border and composition', '2005-04-08 01:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278510, 161031, 31637, '<td valign="top">great DOF. and lighting</td>', 'great DOF. and lighting', '2005-04-08 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278512, 162323, 25464, '<td valign="top">The lighting is interesting.  I think a bit tighter crop would improve.  Maybe a little soft, but I like the painting like effect.</td>', 'The lighting is interesting.  I think a bit tighter crop would improve.  Maybe a little soft, but I like the painting like effect.', '2005-04-08 01:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278513, 161788, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice job here. like it''s name too...7</td>', 'nice job here. like it''s name too...7', '2005-04-08 01:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278514, 161469, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a face!  THe eyes tell the whole story don''t they?  THis could be a great shot if the background was more solid and a different color, the blue really fights with the gray for attention and the lighting was better, the light here comes off a bit harsh and unforgiving.  Also the focus seems off just a bit, not much, but just a bit, especially in the eyes.  A 4</td>', 'What a face!  THe eyes tell the whole story don''t they?  THis could be a great shot if the background was more solid and a different color, the blue really fights with the gray for attention and the lighting was better, the light here comes off a bit harsh and unforgiving.  Also the focus seems off just a bit, not much, but just a bit, especially in the eyes.  A 4', '2005-04-08 01:07:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1278515, 161812, 31637, '<td valign="top">how much are you feeding him! nice lighting</td>', 'how much are you feeding him! nice lighting', '2005-04-08 01:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278516, 161361, 25464, '<td valign="top">Add a highlight to the eye and it will give this a bit more life.  Very nice as is.</td>', 'Add a highlight to the eye and it will give this a bit more life.  Very nice as is.', '2005-04-08 01:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278517, 162820, 12448, '<td valign="top">Aw, so cute!  Chewing on his toy!  Very cute candid snapshot but not really a portrait type.  The flash off the back wall is very distracting and fights with Chewie for attention.  A 4</td>', 'Aw, so cute!  Chewing on his toy!  Very cute candid snapshot but not really a portrait type.  The flash off the back wall is very distracting and fights with Chewie for attention.  A 4', '2005-04-08 01:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278518, 162990, 31637, '<td valign="top">great backlighting  8</td>', 'great backlighting  8', '2005-04-08 01:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278521, 161156, 31637, '<td valign="top">sweet photo...great detail and good lighting  7</td>', 'sweet photo...great detail and good lighting  7', '2005-04-08 01:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278522, 162897, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the detail and sepia tone.</td>', 'I like the detail and sepia tone.', '2005-04-08 01:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278523, 162987, 12448, '<td valign="top">OOOOOOOOooooooh!  I love this shot.  The stance, the intense look, the backdrop.  The only thing that bothers me is the light.  Casts a pink hew on the dog''s white parts and yes my monitor is calibrated. :)  A 9</td>', 'OOOOOOOOooooooh!  I love this shot.  The stance, the intense look, the backdrop.  The only thing that bothers me is the light.  Casts a pink hew on the dog''s white parts and yes my monitor is calibrated. :)  A 9', '2005-04-08 01:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278524, 162323, 31637, '<td valign="top">good attempt..but too dark</td>', 'good attempt..but too dark', '2005-04-08 01:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278525, 162781, 31637, '<td valign="top">well..this wont go far in this challenge...next time !</td>', 'well..this wont go far in this challenge...next time !', '2005-04-08 01:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278526, 161617, 31637, '<td valign="top">is it real? so dark</td>', 'is it real? so dark', '2005-04-08 01:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278527, 163108, 12448, '<td valign="top">Aw, so sweet!  I must have said that a million times already during this challenge, LOL!<br/> <br/>I like this shot, the lighting, the pose, the background, all classic portrait.  But can you guess the one thing that bothers me?  I bet you can because you''ve probably heard it a couple of time, what happened to that pretty tail on the doggie on the right? :)  A 9</td>', 'Aw, so sweet!  I must have said that a million times already during this challenge, LOL! I like this shot, the lighting, the pose, the background, all classic portrait.  But can you guess the one thing that bothers me?  I bet you can because you''ve probably heard it a couple of time, what happened to that pretty tail on the doggie on the right? :)  A 9', '2005-04-08 01:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278529, 162701, 31637, '<td valign="top">good lighting..7</td>', 'good lighting..7', '2005-04-08 01:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278530, 162427, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great eyes.  I like the sepia tone and the tight crop.</td>', 'Great eyes.  I like the sepia tone and the tight crop.', '2005-04-08 01:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278531, 163084, 12448, '<td valign="top">And she looks every bit the part of a Diva!  Very nicely done, the only problem I have is the pink hue on the shot.  A 9</td>', 'And she looks every bit the part of a Diva!  Very nicely done, the only problem I have is the pink hue on the shot.  A 9', '2005-04-08 01:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278532, 162480, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice details on the black cat.  So hard to do with black animals!  I love this shot, everything about it except for the (I''m sure you''ve heard this before) the hot spot on the right.  Otherwise, this would have been a 10 easily, as is a 9</td>', 'Nice details on the black cat.  So hard to do with black animals!  I love this shot, everything about it except for the (I''m sure you''ve heard this before) the hot spot on the right.  Otherwise, this would have been a 10 easily, as is a 9', '2005-04-08 01:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278533, 161971, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, but I think the extremely shallow DOF is a bit over the top.  The composition and focus on the closest eye are very good.</td>', 'I really like this one, but I think the extremely shallow DOF is a bit over the top.  The composition and focus on the closest eye are very good.', '2005-04-08 01:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278534, 162264, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting eyes.</td>', 'Interesting eyes.', '2005-04-08 01:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278537, 162788, 12448, '<td valign="top">OMG! He''s beautiful!  I''m assuming it''s a he, sorry if not.  This is a great shot, the expression, the backdrop, the lighting, the only thing missing is the POP to make the colors really stand out. Maybe a slight adjustment in Levels or curves to really make it bark out!  A 9</td>', 'OMG! He''s beautiful!  I''m assuming it''s a he, sorry if not.  This is a great shot, the expression, the backdrop, the lighting, the only thing missing is the POP to make the colors really stand out. Maybe a slight adjustment in Levels or curves to really make it bark out!  A 9', '2005-04-08 01:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278540, 161178, 25464, '<td valign="top">Creeepy.  Great detail.  Great composition.</td>', 'Creeepy.  Great detail.  Great composition.', '2005-04-08 01:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278545, 161390, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Lighting is dramatic.  The bottom of the boxers foot showing is the only drawback I see here.  I think this would have been perfect if cropped right behind the cat leaving out the boxers leg al together.</td>', 'Interesting.  Lighting is dramatic.  The bottom of the boxers foot showing is the only drawback I see here.  I think this would have been perfect if cropped right behind the cat leaving out the boxers leg al together.', '2005-04-08 01:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278548, 161749, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think that the kitty is overwhelmed by the surroundings.  This kitty should be the subject, but is too small in this shot to have a chance.</td>', 'I think that the kitty is overwhelmed by the surroundings.  This kitty should be the subject, but is too small in this shot to have a chance.', '2005-04-08 01:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278550, 162959, 25464, '<td valign="top">The eyes look very over edited.  That may not be the case, but they appear that way.</td>', 'The eyes look very over edited.  That may not be the case, but they appear that way.', '2005-04-08 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278553, 162700, 25464, '<td valign="top">A portrait should really showcase one subject or group of subjects.  Here you have two separate and competing subjects.  The cat is supposed to be the subject, and from this angle it has no real appeal.</td>', 'A portrait should really showcase one subject or group of subjects.  Here you have two separate and competing subjects.  The cat is supposed to be the subject, and from this angle it has no real appeal.', '2005-04-08 01:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278555, 162272, 25464, '<td valign="top">The focus on the face seems way too soft.  The focus seems to be locked in on the ears instead.</td>', 'The focus on the face seems way too soft.  The focus seems to be locked in on the ears instead.', '2005-04-08 01:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278556, 162966, 25464, '<td valign="top">The missing background makes this cat appear to be floating.</td>', 'The missing background makes this cat appear to be floating.', '2005-04-08 01:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278559, 162883, 25464, '<td valign="top">Cute rat, but soft focus on the nose and whiskers and cluttered background make this a snap shot.</td>', 'Cute rat, but soft focus on the nose and whiskers and cluttered background make this a snap shot.', '2005-04-08 01:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278560, 162678, 25464, '<td valign="top">The bunny had potential, but the background and other items are competing for the attention of the viewer and winning.  A photo of this bunny on a plain black background would have been a much better choice.</td>', 'The bunny had potential, but the background and other items are competing for the attention of the viewer and winning.  A photo of this bunny on a plain black background would have been a much better choice.', '2005-04-08 01:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278579, 162807, 772, '<td valign="top">Every now and then I come across a great photo and I like to comment on it.  The image itself is just wonderful.  The cat is looking at you and the "I like food" tag on the collar is just great :)  THAT should be the theme of this image.  Your title drags the thought away from that theme quite a bit.  This photo gets a 10 from me.  I have a feeling it won''t do particularly well overall though, even though I wish it would be a ribbon winner :)</td>', 'Every now and then I come across a great photo and I like to comment on it.  The image itself is just wonderful.  The cat is looking at you and the "I like food" tag on the collar is just great :)  THAT should be the theme of this image.  Your title drags the thought away from that theme quite a bit.  This photo gets a 10 from me.  I have a feeling it won''t do particularly well overall though, even though I wish it would be a ribbon winner :)', '2005-04-08 01:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278592, 162952, 33504, '<td valign="top">Wow great job!</td>', 'Wow great job!', '2005-04-08 02:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278635, 162713, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very Sharp!  The Cat''s pose is very nice, almost glamourous, like on a fashionshow ramp. Colour tones are very nice, giving those green eyes plenty of space to ''bloom'' their way to the audiance. The fur is very well lit, which gives very good texture to the shoot. Two things i''m not too fond of tho; the composition is odd to me. I understand the vertical crop, but somehow, i find the belly cut a bit ''out of character'' for a cat, especially since i think we see the begining of the rear right leg. Other thing i''m not too fond of is the ''floor'' / ''wall'' set. The two tones in colours clash a little bit too much for my taste. Overall, very nice, sharp and colourful. Nice youngster cat as well! Must be evil at best ;)  8</td>', 'Very Sharp!  The Cat''s pose is very nice, almost glamourous, like on a fashionshow ramp. Colour tones are very nice, giving those green eyes plenty of space to ''bloom'' their way to the audiance. The fur is very well lit, which gives very good texture to the shoot. Two things i''m not too fond of tho; the composition is odd to me. I understand the vertical crop, but somehow, i find the belly cut a bit ''out of character'' for a cat, especially since i think we see the begining of the rear right leg. Other thing i''m not too fond of is the ''floor'' / ''wall'' set. The two tones in colours clash a little bit too much for my taste. Overall, very nice, sharp and colourful. Nice youngster cat as well! Must be evil at best ;)  8', '2005-04-08 03:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278638, 161996, 25571, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Composition. This picture screams "Publicity".  I find the colours slightly ''off'' and i believe the portrait could''ve used a little bit more sharpening. Lightning is very nice, but appears a tiny bit washed out on the neck and cheek. Could be my monitor tho. Very cool expression Stanley has. Also love the symetry of the hears with the rest of the shot. Frame is perharps a little too big, but works in enclosing the portrait. Very likable! 8</td>', 'Beautiful Composition. This picture screams "Publicity".  I find the colours slightly ''off'' and i believe the portrait could''ve used a little bit more sharpening. Lightning is very nice, but appears a tiny bit washed out on the neck and cheek. Could be my monitor tho. Very cool expression Stanley has. Also love the symetry of the hears with the rest of the shot. Frame is perharps a little too big, but works in enclosing the portrait. Very likable! 8', '2005-04-08 03:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278642, 162819, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on the sunset. Its a bit of shame that the dog is not better lit; that''s where a mounted flash helps quite a lot.  Colours are rich and vibrant. Composition is missing something.  Perharps to the fact that its a little off ''cause of the tail. I also find myself wanting to see more of the reflection. Nice work ! 7</td>', 'Very nice lighting on the sunset. Its a bit of shame that the dog is not better lit; that''s where a mounted flash helps quite a lot.  Colours are rich and vibrant. Composition is missing something.  Perharps to the fact that its a little off ''cause of the tail. I also find myself wanting to see more of the reflection. Nice work ! 7', '2005-04-08 03:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278643, 163087, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting. LOving the composition as well. Honestly, i can''t find much i don''t like about this picture, aside perharps from  skulls upper extremity, which appears slightly blurred or simply a tiny bit out of focus. I believe a frame of sort would do some good as well. 9</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting. LOving the composition as well. Honestly, i can''t find much i don''t like about this picture, aside perharps from  skulls upper extremity, which appears slightly blurred or simply a tiny bit out of focus. I believe a frame of sort would do some good as well. 9', '2005-04-08 03:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
