(1279296, 161682, 28299, '<td valign="top">I see a ribbon!! And I''m pretty sure I know whose work this is. Lovely, absolutely lovely! Perfect example of pet portraiture. Please give us all details about what you use to post process. All your photos have a smooth painted effect. (Of course, if I''m wrong about who I''m thinking, I''ll have to eat my words, but it won''t matter, it''s still amazing!) 10</td>', 'I see a ribbon!! And I''m pretty sure I know whose work this is. Lovely, absolutely lovely! Perfect example of pet portraiture. Please give us all details about what you use to post process. All your photos have a smooth painted effect. (Of course, if I''m wrong about who I''m thinking, I''ll have to eat my words, but it won''t matter, it''s still amazing!) 10', '2005-04-08 12:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
