(1279665, 161390, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very pretty duo you''ve got there! Its the first time i see a cat with a fur like that. Beautiful. I like the simple composition of this shot. Its peaceful, and with both animals relaxed, it gives a very friendly and calm mood. Colours are rich as well, which gives some warmth to the shot. I find the carpet a bit distracting with the dark background, separating the pic in a wierd fashion. A little bit more lighting on the animal''s left part of the face could''ve helped slightly, as they seem to be drawn out of the pic. I really like it, good work! 7</td>', 'Very pretty duo you''ve got there! Its the first time i see a cat with a fur like that. Beautiful. I like the simple composition of this shot. Its peaceful, and with both animals relaxed, it gives a very friendly and calm mood. Colours are rich as well, which gives some warmth to the shot. I find the carpet a bit distracting with the dark background, separating the pic in a wierd fashion. A little bit more lighting on the animal''s left part of the face could''ve helped slightly, as they seem to be drawn out of the pic. I really like it, good work! 7', '2005-04-08 15:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
