(1280377, 162987, 30861, '<td valign="top">A "true" portrait, which I appreciate. The image is appealing, but has some slight flaws: it''s cropped a little tight to the paws, for one thing. It would be better if the off hind leg were not occluded by the left front leg. And it would be improved dramatically by dropping the camera down a bit more than yoiu already did. Still, a stroing image and a stron score from me. probably won''t beat the "cute" shots, but a nice piece of work.</td>', 'A "true" portrait, which I appreciate. The image is appealing, but has some slight flaws: it''s cropped a little tight to the paws, for one thing. It would be better if the off hind leg were not occluded by the left front leg. And it would be improved dramatically by dropping the camera down a bit more than yoiu already did. Still, a stroing image and a stron score from me. probably won''t beat the "cute" shots, but a nice piece of work.', '2005-04-09 02:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
