(1280385, 163018, 30861, '<td valign="top">In MY perosnal opinion this is by far the best shot in the challenge, and it''s my only 10. it''s the only one of these shots I''d want to hang on the wall iuf I weren''t connected to the animal emotionally. The composition is really terrific, the sense of place is immacualte, the tones are lovely, the animal has a certain "presence" that is appealing. I hope it does well but fear it will be eclipsed by ''cute"</td>', 'In MY perosnal opinion this is by far the best shot in the challenge, and it''s my only 10. it''s the only one of these shots I''d want to hang on the wall iuf I weren''t connected to the animal emotionally. The composition is really terrific, the sense of place is immacualte, the tones are lovely, the animal has a certain "presence" that is appealing. I hope it does well but fear it will be eclipsed by ''cute"', '2005-04-09 02:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
