(1280393, 163085, 30861, '<td valign="top">The best of the fishies. Very appealing. The belnding of the BG to darker at the edges gives a nice sense of dense luminosity. The fish "feels" alittle less sharp than he might be... Strong entry. I hope people agree fish can be pets.</td>', 'The best of the fishies. Very appealing. The belnding of the BG to darker at the edges gives a nice sense of dense luminosity. The fish "feels" alittle less sharp than he might be... Strong entry. I hope people agree fish can be pets.', '2005-04-09 02:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1280397, 163089, 30861, '<td valign="top">Can''t do much better in portraying "white" than this. technically wonderful. Composition a bit blah, might be helped by backing off a tad and getting a bit more dog shape, I donno. Stron entry.</td>', 'Can''t do much better in portraying "white" than this. technically wonderful. Composition a bit blah, might be helped by backing off a tad and getting a bit more dog shape, I donno. Stron entry.', '2005-04-09 02:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1280399, 162990, 30861, '<td valign="top">So much to like here. Lighting is terrific, if a tad harsh on the muzzle. The muted tonalities suit well. Composition seems a bit off to me, maybe crop a tad left and top, I''m not sure. Strong entry.</td>', 'So much to like here. Lighting is terrific, if a tad harsh on the muzzle. The muted tonalities suit well. Composition seems a bit off to me, maybe crop a tad left and top, I''m not sure. Strong entry.', '2005-04-09 02:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1280401, 161390, 30861, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, marred IMO by shadows that are a bit too blocked up. If i coudl see just a tad of separation of the right sides of the animals from the empty BG the image would gain a point. really sweet shot.</td>', 'Powerful image, marred IMO by shadows that are a bit too blocked up. If i coudl see just a tad of separation of the right sides of the animals from the empty BG the image would gain a point. really sweet shot.', '2005-04-09 02:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
