(1281877, 161743, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go around  =) - So cute!  I would have liked to have seen it cropped so it only shows the door with the cat''s face, instead of th eone on the right too.  However, I love the tone you used and excellent contrast &amp; grey scale.  Overall, great job!</td>', 'This is my second go around  =) - So cute!  I would have liked to have seen it cropped so it only shows the door with the cat''s face, instead of th eone on the right too.  However, I love the tone you used and excellent contrast & grey scale.  Overall, great job!', '2005-04-10 10:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
