(1282096, 162145, 6519, '<td valign="top">Catching an animal running around would not normally count as "portrait", but since you can hardly sit a horse on a table with some posterboard behind and some carefully placed spotlight, I''ll "let you get away with it" this time *g*.<br/> <br/>The blur is ok, but I would like to see this photo with the white bar cloned out, and the perhaps the sky a touch bluer (all this coming from a purist *s*).<br/> <br/>Beautifully captured, a perfect moment in time, the light couldn''t be better - LOVELY SHOT!!! 8</td>', 'Catching an animal running around would not normally count as "portrait", but since you can hardly sit a horse on a table with some posterboard behind and some carefully placed spotlight, I''ll "let you get away with it" this time *g*. The blur is ok, but I would like to see this photo with the white bar cloned out, and the perhaps the sky a touch bluer (all this coming from a purist *s*). Beautifully captured, a perfect moment in time, the light couldn''t be better - LOVELY SHOT!!! 8', '2005-04-10 15:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
