(1282109, 161996, 32221, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait, congratulations on an excellent job.</td>', 'This is a great portrait, congratulations on an excellent job.', '2005-04-10 15:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282117, 162850, 23412, '<td valign="top">On of my top pics.  Great eyes.  The only minor quibble I have with this picture is the bottom left corner.  The detail seems to have been adjusted using a filter (whether this is a natural or post-processing effect, I don''t know), which is not consistent with the look on the other cheek.  Honestly, I kind of like the effect on the bottom left.  Anyway, great crop, great subject, great job!</td>', 'On of my top pics.  Great eyes.  The only minor quibble I have with this picture is the bottom left corner.  The detail seems to have been adjusted using a filter (whether this is a natural or post-processing effect, I don''t know), which is not consistent with the look on the other cheek.  Honestly, I kind of like the effect on the bottom left.  Anyway, great crop, great subject, great job!', '2005-04-10 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282120, 161682, 23412, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  One of my top picks.  I especially like the way all the colors work together.  In that particular color range, this is a rare feat, IMO.  Good job getting the dogs to cooperate as well.  My personal experiences with photographing multiple dogs have been hectic ones.  I suppose well mannered dogs make the difference, but you did a great job with this great looking duo.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  One of my top picks.  I especially like the way all the colors work together.  In that particular color range, this is a rare feat, IMO.  Good job getting the dogs to cooperate as well.  My personal experiences with photographing multiple dogs have been hectic ones.  I suppose well mannered dogs make the difference, but you did a great job with this great looking duo.', '2005-04-10 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
