(1282124, 162027, 23412, '<td valign="top">One of the best cat shots, IMO.  Your pose was unique and the focus is great.  I would have preferred a different backdrop or at least more color contrast between the cat and the backdrop.  As it is, it takes a minute to decide where the cat stops and the backdrop begins.  Anyway, it is a great shot as it is.</td>', 'One of the best cat shots, IMO.  Your pose was unique and the focus is great.  I would have preferred a different backdrop or at least more color contrast between the cat and the backdrop.  As it is, it takes a minute to decide where the cat stops and the backdrop begins.  Anyway, it is a great shot as it is.', '2005-04-10 15:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
