(1282129, 162819, 23412, '<td valign="top">The light in this is fantastiic; The color of the water is prefect.  Unfortunately, the dog''s face seems to be relatively in shadow as a result of the bright background.  Still a great pic and one of my top pics.</td>', 'The light in this is fantastiic; The color of the water is prefect.  Unfortunately, the dog''s face seems to be relatively in shadow as a result of the bright background.  Still a great pic and one of my top pics.', '2005-04-10 15:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
