(1282343, 161996, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great looking dog. excellent portrait too, except for the lighting on the right eye, which is just too dark, and the lack of a catchlight is unsettling. On the other hand, the whole effect did force me to look closer at the image, so you must be doing something right :) <br/></td>', 'Great looking dog. excellent portrait too, except for the lighting on the right eye, which is just too dark, and the lack of a catchlight is unsettling. On the other hand, the whole effect did force me to look closer at the image, so you must be doing something right :) ', '2005-04-10 17:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
