(1282360, 162818, 27605, '<td valign="top">I for one really like the soft-focus / shallow DOF effect you have used here.  I might like a slightly wider crop to the right a bit better, also not fond of the black border (tho both are minor nitpicks).  ....7....</td>', 'I for one really like the soft-focus / shallow DOF effect you have used here.  I might like a slightly wider crop to the right a bit better, also not fond of the black border (tho both are minor nitpicks).  ....7....', '2005-04-10 17:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
