(1282362, 163077, 27605, '<td valign="top">SUPER color, like the bokeh also.  Would prefer the head facing the camera just a bit more, perhaps also more catchlight in the eye.  Still magnificent!    ....7....</td>', 'SUPER color, like the bokeh also.  Would prefer the head facing the camera just a bit more, perhaps also more catchlight in the eye.  Still magnificent!    ....7....', '2005-04-10 17:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
