(1282387, 161565, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nicely sharp. Very colorful too without being overly saturated. Only thing I''m not too fond of is the white band at the top of the image as it draws the eye a little too much.</td>', 'Good composition and nicely sharp. Very colorful too without being overly saturated. Only thing I''m not too fond of is the white band at the top of the image as it draws the eye a little too much.', '2005-04-10 17:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282389, 162275, 31230, '<td valign="top">A little grainy</td>', 'A little grainy', '2005-04-10 17:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282390, 163018, 36231, '<td valign="top">Very clever ... I like the black and white, and how she''s sitting pretty like a piece of art!</td>', 'Very clever ... I like the black and white, and how she''s sitting pretty like a piece of art!', '2005-04-10 17:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282392, 162971, 36231, '<td valign="top">Say "Cheese!"</td>', 'Say "Cheese!"', '2005-04-10 17:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282393, 162725, 25464, '<td valign="top">Centered works well here.  I think a bit tighter crop might have improved the composition a bit.  I tend to think you should show all of the feet if any of the feet in this type of pose.  Eyes are nice.  Black and white also works well.</td>', 'Centered works well here.  I think a bit tighter crop might have improved the composition a bit.  I tend to think you should show all of the feet if any of the feet in this type of pose.  Eyes are nice.  Black and white also works well.', '2005-04-10 17:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282394, 162700, 36231, '<td valign="top">Very unusual ...</td>', 'Very unusual ...', '2005-04-10 17:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282397, 161739, 6008, '<td valign="top">An interesting moody and warm light. Not too fond of the composition and think cropping out some of the left side would put more emphasis on the face. Think having more of the feet in the shot may have helped some too. Additionally not fond of the two white blobs in the background as they draw the eye a little. They seem fairly isolated and could be easily cloned out.</td>', 'An interesting moody and warm light. Not too fond of the composition and think cropping out some of the left side would put more emphasis on the face. Think having more of the feet in the shot may have helped some too. Additionally not fond of the two white blobs in the background as they draw the eye a little. They seem fairly isolated and could be easily cloned out.', '2005-04-10 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282400, 161178, 25371, '<td valign="top">cool name for cool guy...</td>', 'cool name for cool guy...', '2005-04-10 17:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282401, 162862, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good even light with sharpness and a good texture on the fur. Background is good and complimentary also. Interesting expression also. Good job!</td>', 'Good even light with sharpness and a good texture on the fur. Background is good and complimentary also. Interesting expression also. Good job!', '2005-04-10 17:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282404, 163090, 25464, '<td valign="top">This has potential, but could be improved in a few ways IMO.  The detail is nice, but maybe a bit too much contrast.  The background is a bit distracting probably mostly due to the excessive contrast.  The lighting looks nice, and the pose is very nice.  I think the composition would be improved by shifting the subject to the left side of the frame or cropping much closer on the left.  The background is competing with the subject for the viewers attention and should be an afterthought.</td>', 'This has potential, but could be improved in a few ways IMO.  The detail is nice, but maybe a bit too much contrast.  The background is a bit distracting probably mostly due to the excessive contrast.  The lighting looks nice, and the pose is very nice.  I think the composition would be improved by shifting the subject to the left side of the frame or cropping much closer on the left.  The background is competing with the subject for the viewers attention and should be an afterthought.', '2005-04-10 17:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282406, 162168, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition but the bowl in the background is a little distracting, especially with the white light reflection. Image seems a little soft also.</td>', 'Good composition but the bowl in the background is a little distracting, especially with the white light reflection. Image seems a little soft also.', '2005-04-10 17:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282409, 162700, 25371, '<td valign="top">Is he/she vegetarian? ;-)</td>', 'Is he/she vegetarian? ;-)', '2005-04-10 17:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282411, 162850, 31230, '<td valign="top">Love those eyes.</td>', 'Love those eyes.', '2005-04-10 17:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282412, 162863, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this is just precious, but I have to say a different choice of background color might have improved it.  I think white or even a darker pink would have put this one over the top for me.  The focus drops off a bit for the eye on the left.  sharpening that area would improve as well.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think this is just precious, but I have to say a different choice of background color might have improved it.  I think white or even a darker pink would have put this one over the top for me.  The focus drops off a bit for the eye on the left.  sharpening that area would improve as well.  Good luck.', '2005-04-10 17:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282415, 161156, 25464, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Nice eyes.  Looks mischievious.</td>', 'Cute.  Nice eyes.  Looks mischievious.', '2005-04-10 17:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282416, 161788, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good environmental portrait. There is a strong sense of presence and pride with the stance and expression. The background grasses contrast nicely with the black of the fur and the orange ''jacket''. Only thing I dont like is the way the rear legs have disappeared in the grass and I dont know if there was a selection involved but there is a strong edge/contrast there that makes it look like the legs have been cut off or missing.</td>', 'Good environmental portrait. There is a strong sense of presence and pride with the stance and expression. The background grasses contrast nicely with the black of the fur and the orange ''jacket''. Only thing I dont like is the way the rear legs have disappeared in the grass and I dont know if there was a selection involved but there is a strong edge/contrast there that makes it look like the legs have been cut off or missing.', '2005-04-10 17:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282417, 162863, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done  Good composition, pose, and contrasts.  One of my top picks for ribbon.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Well done  Good composition, pose, and contrasts.  One of my top picks for ribbon.  Bumping up.', '2005-04-10 17:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282420, 161791, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done  I like the angle you chose here and the choice of B&amp;W.  Good composition, pose, and contrasts.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Well done  I like the angle you chose here and the choice of B&W.  Good composition, pose, and contrasts.  Bumping up.', '2005-04-10 17:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282422, 163102, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Not a fan of the border treatment, but the half cocked ear adds the illusion of motion.  The detail is nice and the eyes look great.</td>', 'I like this one.  Not a fan of the border treatment, but the half cocked ear adds the illusion of motion.  The detail is nice and the eyes look great.', '2005-04-10 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282425, 162413, 6008, '<td valign="top">The eyes are certainly interesting. I also like the softness of the fur. I dont think the fence really adds that much to the image and think it would have looked better cropped out. The background is also a little light and could use a slight burn to darken it so the emphasis goes back to the cat.</td>', 'The eyes are certainly interesting. I also like the softness of the fur. I dont think the fence really adds that much to the image and think it would have looked better cropped out. The background is also a little light and could use a slight burn to darken it so the emphasis goes back to the cat.', '2005-04-10 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282429, 162690, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one is dramatic but lacks a bit in execution.  The green eyes really pop, but the lighting is a bit too harsh (shadow under chin) and the srarpness needed to pull out the detail and make the dark subject dark background shot work is just not there.  I would definitely try a reshoot.  Good eye.  Just needs a little tweeking.</td>', 'This one is dramatic but lacks a bit in execution.  The green eyes really pop, but the lighting is a bit too harsh (shadow under chin) and the srarpness needed to pull out the detail and make the dark subject dark background shot work is just not there.  I would definitely try a reshoot.  Good eye.  Just needs a little tweeking.', '2005-04-10 17:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282431, 162052, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it is just the softness and low contrast but it almost looks like a filter has been added to the image. It''s a fairly static image but there is something about it that is quite attractive. It has a slight fantastical feel to it even if the horse doesnt look like the perfect specimen. I like it.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it is just the softness and low contrast but it almost looks like a filter has been added to the image. It''s a fairly static image but there is something about it that is quite attractive. It has a slight fantastical feel to it even if the horse doesnt look like the perfect specimen. I like it.', '2005-04-10 17:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282432, 162990, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot of this dog.  I think a portrait mode composition would have worked better and I think using the rule of thirds would have made it more interesting than the centered approach.  As composed, the equal balance between dog below his head and space above his head gives me a "chopped" impression on the dogs body--you want to see more.  Still, very nice lighting and capture  (7)</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot of this dog.  I think a portrait mode composition would have worked better and I think using the rule of thirds would have made it more interesting than the centered approach.  As composed, the equal balance between dog below his head and space above his head gives me a "chopped" impression on the dogs body--you want to see more.  Still, very nice lighting and capture  (7)', '2005-04-10 17:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282433, 162421, 25464, '<td valign="top">I find the red background a bit off putting, but the detail and focus are great.  The tip of the ear falling out of the frame is a bit distracting as well.</td>', 'I find the red background a bit off putting, but the detail and focus are great.  The tip of the ear falling out of the frame is a bit distracting as well.', '2005-04-10 17:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282436, 162317, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a beatiful shot.  I love the pose and the expression.  The only improvement to me might have been a bit more light and sharpness in the dogs eyes.  Bumping up!</td>', 'This is a beatiful shot.  I love the pose and the expression.  The only improvement to me might have been a bit more light and sharpness in the dogs eyes.  Bumping up!', '2005-04-10 17:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282439, 162973, 19503, '<td valign="top">My fav. in this challange, love the soft fabric, warm colors and soft light. Good Job.</td>', 'My fav. in this challange, love the soft fabric, warm colors and soft light. Good Job.', '2005-04-10 17:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282440, 162275, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s good that you''ve tried to ''hide'' the background with a backdrop but the creases and depth of field make it become part of the image more than just a background. The image is also fairly noisy, which could be because of poor light or too much exposure correction. The focus also looks a little off, again this could be because of poor/dim lighting. The composition is good.</td>', 'It''s good that you''ve tried to ''hide'' the background with a backdrop but the creases and depth of field make it become part of the image more than just a background. The image is also fairly noisy, which could be because of poor light or too much exposure correction. The focus also looks a little off, again this could be because of poor/dim lighting. The composition is good.', '2005-04-10 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282441, 161742, 25464, '<td valign="top">Stan looks angry.  The light portion of the background on the right is distracting my attention from the subject.  The almost glowing lighting is nice, but seems out of place on this serious kitty.  The eyes have great detail and focus.</td>', 'Stan looks angry.  The light portion of the background on the right is distracting my attention from the subject.  The almost glowing lighting is nice, but seems out of place on this serious kitty.  The eyes have great detail and focus.', '2005-04-10 17:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282447, 162713, 12253, '<td valign="top">Revisiting for comment.  Excellent cat portrait.  Lighting is perfect, as is composition.  At first, the table edge or whatever the corner line is seemed a distraction, but I really do like the two toned split it provides the shot: lighter on the bottom surface, and darker to the right.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Revisiting for comment.  Excellent cat portrait.  Lighting is perfect, as is composition.  At first, the table edge or whatever the corner line is seemed a distraction, but I really do like the two toned split it provides the shot: lighter on the bottom surface, and darker to the right.  Bumping up.', '2005-04-10 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282450, 162807, 25371, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately it''s not sharp... 9</td>', 'Unfortunately it''s not sharp... 9', '2005-04-10 17:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282453, 163053, 12253, '<td valign="top">Revisiting for comment.  Excellent portrait--great capture of expression.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Revisiting for comment.  Excellent portrait--great capture of expression.  Bumping up.', '2005-04-10 17:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282455, 163096, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the use of perspective on the shot, although I think it usually looks better on a lighter background so it doesnt look like the dog is floating. The strong color cast seems to suggest a slight white balance issue also.</td>', 'I like the use of perspective on the shot, although I think it usually looks better on a lighter background so it doesnt look like the dog is floating. The strong color cast seems to suggest a slight white balance issue also.', '2005-04-10 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282457, 162990, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light - it really sets the mood. A classic portrait. Only improvement I can see is a slight crop off the bottom to hide the gray bar in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'Wonderful light - it really sets the mood. A classic portrait. Only improvement I can see is a slight crop off the bottom to hide the gray bar in the bottom right corner.', '2005-04-10 18:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282465, 161971, 6008, '<td valign="top">The depth of field seems a little too shallow. I think having more in focus and a little sharper so the texture of the skin can be seen would improve the overall  aesthetics.</td>', 'The depth of field seems a little too shallow. I think having more in focus and a little sharper so the texture of the skin can be seen would improve the overall  aesthetics.', '2005-04-10 18:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
