(1282630, 161812, 8860, '<td valign="top">One of the best views yet of a squirrel''s tail. Excellent.<br/> <br/>I had a ''pet'' squirrel once - rescued a baby that fell from nest - nurtured it for weeks and then released it. Called Chippy.<br/>: )<br/> <br/>Your composition is a bit ordinary/snap shot, so the portrait element is quite weak, but it''s a good capture with some nice light.</td>', 'One of the best views yet of a squirrel''s tail. Excellent. I had a ''pet'' squirrel once - rescued a baby that fell from nest - nurtured it for weeks and then released it. Called Chippy.: ) Your composition is a bit ordinary/snap shot, so the portrait element is quite weak, but it''s a good capture with some nice light.', '2005-04-10 20:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
