(1282761, 162681, 6008, '<td valign="top">The composition looks good but (at least on my monitor) the image seems a little dark. As such it also seems a little soft. I like the catchlights in the eyes.</td>', 'The composition looks good but (at least on my monitor) the image seems a little dark. As such it also seems a little soft. I like the catchlights in the eyes.', '2005-04-10 22:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
