(1282778, 161837, 7910, '<td valign="top">nice expression.</td>', 'nice expression.', '2005-04-10 22:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282779, 161614, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the monochromatic tone of the image as well as the depth of field. The stare is very hypnotic and the eyes are nice and large. The green in the left corner isnt so much a distracting as just something I would prefer not to be there.</td>', 'I like the monochromatic tone of the image as well as the depth of field. The stare is very hypnotic and the eyes are nice and large. The green in the left corner isnt so much a distracting as just something I would prefer not to be there.', '2005-04-10 22:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282783, 162938, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition and focus. I like the warm tones in the background but wish it could have stretched the entire length of it. The eyes are usually the big draw with cats and so it''s interesting to see this one with the eyes not visible. Seems a little noisy but not distractingly so.</td>', 'Good composition and focus. I like the warm tones in the background but wish it could have stretched the entire length of it. The eyes are usually the big draw with cats and so it''s interesting to see this one with the eyes not visible. Seems a little noisy but not distractingly so.', '2005-04-10 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282787, 162883, 23412, '<td valign="top">Good picture of the rodent (hamster?).  While I appreciate the difficulties you must face in getting one of these guys to pose, I would really prefer this picture without the person in the background.  The hand is a detractor as well, IMO.  Good shot of the hamster, though.  My points are really more about composition than the primary subject, which you captured well.</td>', 'Good picture of the rodent (hamster?).  While I appreciate the difficulties you must face in getting one of these guys to pose, I would really prefer this picture without the person in the background.  The hand is a detractor as well, IMO.  Good shot of the hamster, though.  My points are really more about composition than the primary subject, which you captured well.', '2005-04-10 22:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282794, 161788, 23412, '<td valign="top">There is an odd effect in this picture.  The grass in the foreground makes the dog look like he has lost his hind quarters.   Maybe that is just me, though.  Now I''m not sure.  Anyway, good looking dog.</td>', 'There is an odd effect in this picture.  The grass in the foreground makes the dog look like he has lost his hind quarters.   Maybe that is just me, though.  Now I''m not sure.  Anyway, good looking dog.', '2005-04-10 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282797, 163018, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition..I like the vase and positioning of cat; the tones in this portrait are very soft, too.</td>', 'This is a nice composition..I like the vase and positioning of cat; the tones in this portrait are very soft, too.', '2005-04-10 22:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282801, 162920, 32754, '<td valign="top">Too much stuff in window detracts from Emilia''s portrait...I think if the plant in middle was moved, it would focus attention on your cat.</td>', 'Too much stuff in window detracts from Emilia''s portrait...I think if the plant in middle was moved, it would focus attention on your cat.', '2005-04-10 22:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282803, 161438, 32754, '<td valign="top">This cat almost blends with background; but in this case,  Shadow seems to be lost in the shot...Maybe if you were a little closer...</td>', 'This cat almost blends with background; but in this case,  Shadow seems to be lost in the shot...Maybe if you were a little closer...', '2005-04-10 22:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282806, 162483, 32754, '<td valign="top">i don''t think this is his best camera angle, only his head is in focus and i''d like to see more of him because of the lovely colors..</td>', 'i don''t think this is his best camera angle, only his head is in focus and i''d like to see more of him because of the lovely colors..', '2005-04-10 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282807, 162567, 32754, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. he has a noble and serious face..</td>', 'Nice portrait. he has a noble and serious face..', '2005-04-10 22:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282813, 163077, 32754, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful color of feathers...I feel that not enough of the bird is shown though..with all the lovely color, the whole body of the bird would have made an extraordinary portrait.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful color of feathers...I feel that not enough of the bird is shown though..with all the lovely color, the whole body of the bird would have made an extraordinary portrait.', '2005-04-10 22:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282814, 161156, 32754, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!  Very alert and aware looking cat.</td>', 'Nice portrait!  Very alert and aware looking cat.', '2005-04-10 22:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282815, 163020, 32754, '<td valign="top">Handsome cat but he''s too blurry..even the eyes are not really clear. Maybe a little too close with camera?</td>', 'Handsome cat but he''s too blurry..even the eyes are not really clear. Maybe a little too close with camera?', '2005-04-10 22:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282824, 161640, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great capture-background really works here-tones bring my eye right back to your cat. Beautiful look   on his/her face.</td>', 'Great capture-background really works here-tones bring my eye right back to your cat. Beautiful look   on his/her face.', '2005-04-10 23:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282825, 162550, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great composition and hairdo!</td>', 'Great composition and hairdo!', '2005-04-10 23:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282826, 162996, 27847, '<td valign="top">I think I just found my cat''s long lost brother!!  What a beautiful face!  A very nice close up.</td>', 'I think I just found my cat''s long lost brother!!  What a beautiful face!  A very nice close up.', '2005-04-10 23:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282829, 163019, 32997, '<td valign="top">The textures fit in on the bedding,  by contrasting the softness of your dog. I like that the one eye is watching! nice shot..</td>', 'The textures fit in on the bedding,  by contrasting the softness of your dog. I like that the one eye is watching! nice shot..', '2005-04-10 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282830, 162027, 27847, '<td valign="top">Hey, my cat does that pose too!  Good use of the black &amp; white.  Love the expression!</td>', 'Hey, my cat does that pose too!  Good use of the black & white.  Love the expression!', '2005-04-10 23:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282831, 163052, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great job-love this idea and focus works wonderfully to support it.</td>', 'Great job-love this idea and focus works wonderfully to support it.', '2005-04-10 23:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282834, 162275, 27847, '<td valign="top">Something just isn''t quite right about this picture...perhaps it''s the graininess, or the expression on the pooch''s face.</td>', 'Something just isn''t quite right about this picture...perhaps it''s the graininess, or the expression on the pooch''s face.', '2005-04-10 23:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282836, 161602, 32997, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting colours between your cat and the background-very effective.</td>', 'Love the contrasting colours between your cat and the background-very effective.', '2005-04-10 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282837, 161440, 27847, '<td valign="top">A noble face enhanced by those beautiful blue eyes.  A wonderful capture!</td>', 'A noble face enhanced by those beautiful blue eyes.  A wonderful capture!', '2005-04-10 23:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282840, 162807, 27847, '<td valign="top">I love the tag!  My cat''s would read " I like sleep"...A very good capture with great expression on the kitty''s face.  Although I enjoy the b&amp;w, I would like to see it in colour.  Overall, a very cute picture!</td>', 'I love the tag!  My cat''s would read " I like sleep"...A very good capture with great expression on the kitty''s face.  Although I enjoy the b&w, I would like to see it in colour.  Overall, a very cute picture!', '2005-04-10 23:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282845, 162857, 27847, '<td valign="top">A crisp, clear picture with excellent colour.  I believe your "unusual pet" is smiling for the camera!</td>', 'A crisp, clear picture with excellent colour.  I believe your "unusual pet" is smiling for the camera!', '2005-04-10 23:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282846, 161996, 32997, '<td valign="top">Fantastic-love this crop. Great work!</td>', 'Fantastic-love this crop. Great work!', '2005-04-10 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282847, 163108, 32265, '<td valign="top">Anyone who can get two Jack Russell''s to sit still like that deserves a high score. By the way - good lighting, posing, and composition. 9</td>', 'Anyone who can get two Jack Russell''s to sit still like that deserves a high score. By the way - good lighting, posing, and composition. 9', '2005-04-10 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282851, 162423, 32265, '<td valign="top">Hilarious and beautifuly captured. 9</td>', 'Hilarious and beautifuly captured. 9', '2005-04-10 23:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282852, 163006, 27847, '<td valign="top">This shot just makes me laugh!  Great title.  Good use of colour &amp; lighting.  A most interesting little creature!</td>', 'This shot just makes me laugh!  Great title.  Good use of colour & lighting.  A most interesting little creature!', '2005-04-10 23:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282857, 162979, 27847, '<td valign="top">The title is perfect!  I think your cat should work as a hypnotist.  This is such a sharp picture, I like everything about it...especially the background...does it represent his "good side" &amp; his "bad side"?  :)  Another one of my favourites in this challenge.  Good luck!  9</td>', 'The title is perfect!  I think your cat should work as a hypnotist.  This is such a sharp picture, I like everything about it...especially the background...does it represent his "good side" & his "bad side"?  :)  Another one of my favourites in this challenge.  Good luck!  9', '2005-04-10 23:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282861, 161472, 6668, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this shot is way too blown out, takes away all detail. sorry</td>', 'The lighting in this shot is way too blown out, takes away all detail. sorry', '2005-04-10 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282868, 163105, 27847, '<td valign="top">How long did you make your poor doggie sit like that?  Must be a very good dog to put up with it!!  :)  Good shot, nice &amp; crisp.</td>', 'How long did you make your poor doggie sit like that?  Must be a very good dog to put up with it!!  :)  Good shot, nice & crisp.', '2005-04-10 23:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282869, 161749, 32265, '<td valign="top">Very funny. I would have liked it better without the tall tree thing, but not much you could have done about that. Very nice.</td>', 'Very funny. I would have liked it better without the tall tree thing, but not much you could have done about that. Very nice.', '2005-04-10 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282872, 161739, 32265, '<td valign="top">I love the warm light on the subject and the cool blues in the background. Has a very pleasent feel to it.</td>', 'I love the warm light on the subject and the cool blues in the background. Has a very pleasent feel to it.', '2005-04-10 23:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282874, 162997, 32265, '<td valign="top">You can just see the age in the eyes.</td>', 'You can just see the age in the eyes.', '2005-04-10 23:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282875, 162270, 27847, '<td valign="top">I love the name!  That''s so cute for a Scottie.  Nice expression, good b&amp;w.  The background is the only thing I would change...it''s just a bit distracting.  Overall, a nice capture!</td>', 'I love the name!  That''s so cute for a Scottie.  Nice expression, good b&w.  The background is the only thing I would change...it''s just a bit distracting.  Overall, a nice capture!', '2005-04-10 23:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282877, 161745, 32265, '<td valign="top">This looks like an over-compressed image. Also looks like some illegal editing was used to get rid of the background. Either leave as is, use a shallower depth of field, or try to find a not distracting backdrop.</td>', 'This looks like an over-compressed image. Also looks like some illegal editing was used to get rid of the background. Either leave as is, use a shallower depth of field, or try to find a not distracting backdrop.', '2005-04-10 23:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282879, 163106, 32997, '<td valign="top">I love that youcaught the predator in your cat here. Focus and composition both excellent.</td>', 'I love that youcaught the predator in your cat here. Focus and composition both excellent.', '2005-04-10 23:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282881, 162970, 32265, '<td valign="top">I swear I''ve seen your dog in Star Wars - Return of the Jedi. The head Ewok if I remember correctly. Nice shot.</td>', 'I swear I''ve seen your dog in Star Wars - Return of the Jedi. The head Ewok if I remember correctly. Nice shot.', '2005-04-10 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282883, 162585, 32265, '<td valign="top">Would''ve liked a darker background if possible to bring out the cat.</td>', 'Would''ve liked a darker background if possible to bring out the cat.', '2005-04-10 23:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282889, 162971, 27847, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''ll admit it...I''m not a big fan of snakes, but this one is really cute.  Nice DOF, very crisp.  And your buddy even smiled for you!</td>', 'Ok, I''ll admit it...I''m not a big fan of snakes, but this one is really cute.  Nice DOF, very crisp.  And your buddy even smiled for you!', '2005-04-10 23:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282891, 162145, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very Nice! 9</td>', 'Very Nice! 9', '2005-04-10 23:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282895, 161837, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, here is an image that is not technically correct, yet the projection is amazing because of the funny expression. I can not overstress the power of this image. It is at once my favorite for this challenge. Bump! And another bump.</td>', 'Now, here is an image that is not technically correct, yet the projection is amazing because of the funny expression. I can not overstress the power of this image. It is at once my favorite for this challenge. Bump! And another bump.', '2005-04-10 23:50:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1282896, 162495, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is an admirable rendition with lighting that adds mystique by creating almost an abstract piece of work, yet the portrait is totally satisfied. Good work. Bumping up. And another bump!</td>', 'This is an admirable rendition with lighting that adds mystique by creating almost an abstract piece of work, yet the portrait is totally satisfied. Good work. Bumping up. And another bump!', '2005-04-10 23:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282898, 162480, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely and magical. A very good study geared to win many hearts at first glance. Bumping up. Another bump before closing.</td>', 'Lovely and magical. A very good study geared to win many hearts at first glance. Bumping up. Another bump before closing.', '2005-04-10 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282904, 162662, 27847, '<td valign="top">Why is this pooch sad?<br/></td>', 'Why is this pooch sad?', '2005-04-10 23:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282907, 163074, 6668, '<td valign="top">Is that even a real deer?? LOL</td>', 'Is that even a real deer?? LOL', '2005-04-10 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282910, 161614, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow! and what a face. bumping up on those well captured eyes.</td>', 'Wow! and what a face. bumping up on those well captured eyes.', '2005-04-10 23:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282912, 162929, 32265, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think it would have looked better without the Photoshop blur on the sides that you applied in post. I find it distracting.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think it would have looked better without the Photoshop blur on the sides that you applied in post. I find it distracting.', '2005-04-10 23:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282913, 161498, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now this guy is real cute. If more care would have been paid to the focusing this image would scire so, so high. Yet, it is still impressive and deserving a bump.</td>', 'Now this guy is real cute. If more care would have been paid to the focusing this image would scire so, so high. Yet, it is still impressive and deserving a bump.', '2005-04-10 23:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282915, 161869, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice and attractive capture of this no-nonsense friend. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice and attractive capture of this no-nonsense friend. Bumping up.', '2005-04-10 23:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282916, 161498, 32265, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I think it could have done without the blurry border.</td>', 'I like the shot, but I think it could have done without the blurry border.', '2005-04-10 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282918, 162997, 22734, '<td valign="top">I am bumping this image because the sweetnes of this guy comes through. A deeper dof would have rendered the eyes sharper.</td>', 'I am bumping this image because the sweetnes of this guy comes through. A deeper dof would have rendered the eyes sharper.', '2005-04-11 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282921, 161418, 22734, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy. Looks a bit semi panicked. Lovely tones. Bumping up.</td>', 'Cute little guy. Looks a bit semi panicked. Lovely tones. Bumping up.', '2005-04-11 00:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282925, 162801, 22734, '<td valign="top">A real beauty. Lovely colors and what an wxpression. Bumping up on sheer charm.</td>', 'A real beauty. Lovely colors and what an wxpression. Bumping up on sheer charm.', '2005-04-11 00:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282926, 161361, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, fish can be very hard to photograph.  I like the composition of the shot, the colors, though they seem just a touch washed out but that may be Wanda''s true colors!  The edge around her on the right seems to sharp for some reason, can''t quite place my finger on it, but it''s just a nit picky thing that jumps out at me personally.  A 7</td>', 'Nice capture, fish can be very hard to photograph.  I like the composition of the shot, the colors, though they seem just a touch washed out but that may be Wanda''s true colors!  The edge around her on the right seems to sharp for some reason, can''t quite place my finger on it, but it''s just a nit picky thing that jumps out at me personally.  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282927, 162982, 22734, '<td valign="top">What a lovely pal. A loving capture with good tones. Bumping up.</td>', 'What a lovely pal. A loving capture with good tones. Bumping up.', '2005-04-11 00:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282928, 161747, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL...I love the grumpy look on his face!!!</td>', 'LOL...I love the grumpy look on his face!!!', '2005-04-11 00:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282929, 162981, 12253, '<td valign="top">Revisiting for comment.  Really great shot--I really love the desaturated tones here.    And the light and composition gives it such character.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Revisiting for comment.  Really great shot--I really love the desaturated tones here.    And the light and composition gives it such character.  Bumping up!', '2005-04-11 00:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282930, 163002, 12448, '<td valign="top">Her Lamb was sure to go!  Just how many comments say that, LOL!<br/> <br/>Cute shot, very sweet but lacks the "wow" factor.  The colors on the grass are fantastic but the lamb seems very dull in comparison.  Maybe if you went more for a facial shot?  As it stand, the lamb actually gets a bit lost in all the frame and space.  A 7</td>', 'Her Lamb was sure to go!  Just how many comments say that, LOL! Cute shot, very sweet but lacks the "wow" factor.  The colors on the grass are fantastic but the lamb seems very dull in comparison.  Maybe if you went more for a facial shot?  As it stand, the lamb actually gets a bit lost in all the frame and space.  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282932, 162901, 22734, '<td valign="top">Sophisticated and detached. Yet all it wants to do is sleep and eat.lol Bumping up on great capture.</td>', 'Sophisticated and detached. Yet all it wants to do is sleep and eat.lol Bumping up on great capture.', '2005-04-11 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282933, 163089, 12253, '<td valign="top">Revisiting for comment.  Beautiful portrait.  Great detail and colors.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Revisiting for comment.  Beautiful portrait.  Great detail and colors.  Bumping up.', '2005-04-11 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282934, 161481, 12448, '<td valign="top">Awww, Charlie is adorable!  Love the expression!<br/> <br/>Very nice frontal shot, the sad look and all but the light seems a tad harsh and the rug does nothing for the shot to me personally.  Softer lighting and a more solid background and floor might help.  A 7</td>', 'Awww, Charlie is adorable!  Love the expression! Very nice frontal shot, the sad look and all but the light seems a tad harsh and the rug does nothing for the shot to me personally.  Softer lighting and a more solid background and floor might help.  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282940, 162027, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely and masterful rendition and gets a good  bump.</td>', 'A lovely and masterful rendition and gets a good  bump.', '2005-04-11 00:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282941, 162966, 22734, '<td valign="top">My congratulations on this  most interesting capture. Bumping up.</td>', 'My congratulations on this  most interesting capture. Bumping up.', '2005-04-11 00:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282945, 162966, 12448, '<td valign="top">Cute, very cute.  The expression is priceless, would like to know just how you did this.<br/> <br/>While a cute shot, black animals can be a nightmare to shoot, I know, having 2 black cats in my home and 4 black horses at Gale''s barn, lighting is everything.  While Fez stands out very nicely against the white backdrop a lot of his detail gets lost in the light.  I can barely see his paw on the right of the shot.  A 7</td>', 'Cute, very cute.  The expression is priceless, would like to know just how you did this. While a cute shot, black animals can be a nightmare to shoot, I know, having 2 black cats in my home and 4 black horses at Gale''s barn, lighting is everything.  While Fez stands out very nicely against the white backdrop a lot of his detail gets lost in the light.  I can barely see his paw on the right of the shot.  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282946, 162610, 22734, '<td valign="top">An expert capture with superb dof to render all detail needed to make this an outstanding study. Bumping up.</td>', 'An expert capture with superb dof to render all detail needed to make this an outstanding study. Bumping up.', '2005-04-11 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282949, 163006, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely and tender capture. Bumping up.</td>', 'A lovely and tender capture. Bumping up.', '2005-04-11 00:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282951, 162943, 12448, '<td valign="top">How cute!  We had a pet goat growing up as well.  They are quite the characters!<br/> <br/>This is a lovely shot, the little smile on his face but with the angle of the shot it almost looks like one of those cards where the dog/cat''s head is way too big for the body.  Same effect here, the body doesn''t look like it could really belong to this same animal.  I like the lighting but the colors still came out just a tad dull.  A 7</td>', 'How cute!  We had a pet goat growing up as well.  They are quite the characters! This is a lovely shot, the little smile on his face but with the angle of the shot it almost looks like one of those cards where the dog/cat''s head is way too big for the body.  Same effect here, the body doesn''t look like it could really belong to this same animal.  I like the lighting but the colors still came out just a tad dull.  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282952, 162907, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice and subtle capture to bring out the beauty in this guy.</td>', 'Nice and subtle capture to bring out the beauty in this guy.', '2005-04-11 00:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282955, 162785, 22734, '<td valign="top">Intriguing capture. A deeper dof would have raised this image way, way up. Bumping up on great composition and adoring composure of the model.</td>', 'Intriguing capture. A deeper dof would have raised this image way, way up. Bumping up on great composition and adoring composure of the model.', '2005-04-11 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282956, 162052, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, looks like the horse I ride once a week.  <br/> <br/>I''m a sucker for horse shots to start with so you get points there but this is just another horse shot, nothing really makes it stand out for me.  A lovely animal, nice effects on the background and such but just nothing to really make it pop or jump out for me.  Perhaps if the horse was cleaned up just a bit (I do know how they love to roll in the mud) and if the horse was looking at you?  A 7</td>', 'Nice shot, looks like the horse I ride once a week.   I''m a sucker for horse shots to start with so you get points there but this is just another horse shot, nothing really makes it stand out for me.  A lovely animal, nice effects on the background and such but just nothing to really make it pop or jump out for me.  Perhaps if the horse was cleaned up just a bit (I do know how they love to roll in the mud) and if the horse was looking at you?  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282957, 162323, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, though there appears to be two vertical lines behind him on the left side that are rather distracting in my opinion, they really take away from the quality of the image.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, though there appears to be two vertical lines behind him on the left side that are rather distracting in my opinion, they really take away from the quality of the image.', '2005-04-11 00:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282960, 161791, 22734, '<td valign="top">What an adorable sweetheart. Bumping up on the charm of those two bewitching eyes.</td>', 'What an adorable sweetheart. Bumping up on the charm of those two bewitching eyes.', '2005-04-11 00:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1282961, 162969, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the cat''s eye.  Decent DOF though it seems the angle is just off for some reason on the focus, the hair right above the eye is OOF, while the hair right under is sharp as a tack, as is the hair towards the nose.  Just seems a little off for some reason.  I like the close crop but using my magic envelopes I think a slightly tighter crop on the left would make a slight differenc in where the viewer''s eyes are drawn.  A 7</td>', 'Nice capture of the cat''s eye.  Decent DOF though it seems the angle is just off for some reason on the focus, the hair right above the eye is OOF, while the hair right under is sharp as a tack, as is the hair towards the nose.  Just seems a little off for some reason.  I like the close crop but using my magic envelopes I think a slightly tighter crop on the left would make a slight differenc in where the viewer''s eyes are drawn.  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
