(1282965, 163085, 12448, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Nice capture, not easy shooting a fish, unless they are in a barrel of course!  Just kidding.<br/> <br/>An Oscar?   Interesting to look at but the lighting leaves much to be desired, very dull and flat and all the debris or algea in the shot could either be cropped out or cloned out.  Some adjustments in Levels or Curves to help the colors really pop and you would have a fantastic shot here instead of just a great one!  :)  A 7</td>', 'Cute!  Nice capture, not easy shooting a fish, unless they are in a barrel of course!  Just kidding. An Oscar?   Interesting to look at but the lighting leaves much to be desired, very dull and flat and all the debris or algea in the shot could either be cropped out or cloned out.  Some adjustments in Levels or Curves to help the colors really pop and you would have a fantastic shot here instead of just a great one!  :)  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
