(1283032, 162539, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a stud he is too!  The one in Gale''s barn is named AJ, short for AppleJack.  <br/> <br/>This is a very nice shot, the angle is well done but I could have lived without the butt, LOL! :)<br/> <br/>Coloration decsion was well done, just a bit of a bright spot on his nose but nothing major.  Was at an 8 (because of the butt) but I''ll forgive you for that and raise you to a 9 :)</td>', 'Wow, what a stud he is too!  The one in Gale''s barn is named AJ, short for AppleJack.   This is a very nice shot, the angle is well done but I could have lived without the butt, LOL! :) Coloration decsion was well done, just a bit of a bright spot on his nose but nothing major.  Was at an 8 (because of the butt) but I''ll forgive you for that and raise you to a 9 :)', '2005-04-11 00:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
