(1283052, 162541, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Fish are so hard to shoot.  I like the colors, the clarity but the other fish on the left and in the lower right end up being a distraction.  This would have been a judgment call if you had decided to clone them out, I don''t feel they are major elements in the shot and would have really helped keep the attention on the center fish.  A 7</td>', 'Very nice.  Fish are so hard to shoot.  I like the colors, the clarity but the other fish on the left and in the lower right end up being a distraction.  This would have been a judgment call if you had decided to clone them out, I don''t feel they are major elements in the shot and would have really helped keep the attention on the center fish.  A 7', '2005-04-11 00:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
