(1283055, 162423, 6008, '<td valign="top">That one ear up in the air is so cute! I''ve seen this scene quite a number of times myself. This is a good environmental portrait and shows quite a bit of personality. Good lighting, exposure, and colors. Cute shot!</td>', 'That one ear up in the air is so cute! I''ve seen this scene quite a number of times myself. This is a good environmental portrait and shows quite a bit of personality. Good lighting, exposure, and colors. Cute shot!', '2005-04-11 00:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1283057, 161472, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oooooooooooo, the light, the light!  Let me get my sunglasses!  Sorry, I couldn''t help myself.  You are probably tired of hearing that.  But the light, while brilliant like your pet I''m sure is a bit overpowering and really takes away from the animal itself.  No detail in those areas.  But I still like the overall compsition and feel of the shot so a 7 for you! ;)</td>', 'Oooooooooooo, the light, the light!  Let me get my sunglasses!  Sorry, I couldn''t help myself.  You are probably tired of hearing that.  But the light, while brilliant like your pet I''m sure is a bit overpowering and really takes away from the animal itself.  No detail in those areas.  But I still like the overall compsition and feel of the shot so a 7 for you! ;)', '2005-04-11 00:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1283060, 163109, 12448, '<td valign="top">Dang!  Congrats on getting this one!  I know how hard it is to capture these little guys, especially to make them sit still long enough.<br/> <br/>I like the highlight in the eye, very nice, the flash is a bit overpowering but not blown out and the background works well, looks very natural.  Had this at a 7 but in the last minutes of the challenge am raising you to a 9!!! WOOT! :)</td>', 'Dang!  Congrats on getting this one!  I know how hard it is to capture these little guys, especially to make them sit still long enough. I like the highlight in the eye, very nice, the flash is a bit overpowering but not blown out and the background works well, looks very natural.  Had this at a 7 but in the last minutes of the challenge am raising you to a 9!!! WOOT! :)', '2005-04-11 00:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
