(1283135, 161000, 12448, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this one before the challenge ended.  I gave you a 7 on this but I think I can explain why you got mostly 5''s.<br/> <br/>On my monitor, the black and white are very distinct and that''s a good thing sometime but in this case, it might have hurt you. The line between the two around the top is so distinct it almost has a cut and paste look to it.  Black animals are so difficult to shoot, I know, 2 black cats in my house as well. While the eyes and nose are in great focus something happened to the paw and lower face on the right.  It''s all blurred out and looks like someone took an eraser and smudged it out to the right.  The lighting on his nose and eyes are well done but the rest seems rather dull and lacks that wow factor.  It''s a really lovely shot and you should be proud to display it, just doesn''t have that stand out from the crowd feel.  Hope he got a lot of treats for posing for you ;)</td>', 'I didn''t get to this one before the challenge ended.  I gave you a 7 on this but I think I can explain why you got mostly 5''s. On my monitor, the black and white are very distinct and that''s a good thing sometime but in this case, it might have hurt you. The line between the two around the top is so distinct it almost has a cut and paste look to it.  Black animals are so difficult to shoot, I know, 2 black cats in my house as well. While the eyes and nose are in great focus something happened to the paw and lower face on the right.  It''s all blurred out and looks like someone took an eraser and smudged it out to the right.  The lighting on his nose and eyes are well done but the rest seems rather dull and lacks that wow factor.  It''s a really lovely shot and you should be proud to display it, just doesn''t have that stand out from the crowd feel.  Hope he got a lot of treats for posing for you ;)', '2005-04-11 01:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283137, 162863, 31637, '<td valign="top">Laurie Im so happy you made a top five finish with this one, I was hopin it would win !</td>', 'Laurie Im so happy you made a top five finish with this one, I was hopin it would win !', '2005-04-11 01:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283141, 162027, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps the most interesting portrait in this challenge. Highly under rated. Congratulations on your 15th place finish.</td>', 'This is perhaps the most interesting portrait in this challenge. Highly under rated. Congratulations on your 15th place finish.', '2005-04-11 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283142, 161791, 20330, '<td valign="top">really nice photo, I could tell the cat was in "psycho mode" as I call it. I love the huge eyes cats make when they are in that mode. nice image! :)</td>', 'really nice photo, I could tell the cat was in "psycho mode" as I call it. I love the huge eyes cats make when they are in that mode. nice image! :)', '2005-04-11 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283143, 161788, 22872, '<td valign="top">I saw you mentioned in a post that you were deaf...I thought you were kidding! I''m not deaf....but I always warn people that I am because I''m hearing impaired....had a hearing aid, but broke it to pieces a few years back and haven''t been able to afford the kind I want (the little one that hardly shows) and unfortunately my insurance doesn''t cover them.  <br/> <br/>Anyhow!  Great looking dog and photo....I have two black ones (wiener dogs)..and you''re right they are hard to photograph....I couldn''t figure what I was doing wrong until an instructor explained how the camera works (gray, white, black) and how you change the camera settings to compensate. :)</td>', 'I saw you mentioned in a post that you were deaf...I thought you were kidding! I''m not deaf....but I always warn people that I am because I''m hearing impaired....had a hearing aid, but broke it to pieces a few years back and haven''t been able to afford the kind I want (the little one that hardly shows) and unfortunately my insurance doesn''t cover them.   Anyhow!  Great looking dog and photo....I have two black ones (wiener dogs)..and you''re right they are hard to photograph....I couldn''t figure what I was doing wrong until an instructor explained how the camera works (gray, white, black) and how you change the camera settings to compensate. :)', '2005-04-11 01:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283144, 161390, 16531, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! Congrats :)</td>', 'Fantastic shot! Congrats :)', '2005-04-11 01:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
