(1283146, 161175, 12448, '<td valign="top">A lot of the reasons are listed below.  I gave this an 8, the distractions are the carpet and the lack of detail in the eyes.  I love the lighting on the hair but it''s not quite enough for most to push it over the top.  But I honestly think the main thing is the carpet, it really detracts from the dog herself.<br/></td>', 'A lot of the reasons are listed below.  I gave this an 8, the distractions are the carpet and the lack of detail in the eyes.  I love the lighting on the hair but it''s not quite enough for most to push it over the top.  But I honestly think the main thing is the carpet, it really detracts from the dog herself.', '2005-04-11 01:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
