(1283183, 161837, 22734, '<td valign="top">This expression alone deserves a ribbon. The photojournalist captures the image the best he can. Sometimes we catch an image which falls short on the technical side. Well, this is a portrait challenge, but I would have gone with this exact image in place of a slicker one. Well, you have made an exceptional capture here and I congratulate you for it.</td>', 'This expression alone deserves a ribbon. The photojournalist captures the image the best he can. Sometimes we catch an image which falls short on the technical side. Well, this is a portrait challenge, but I would have gone with this exact image in place of a slicker one. Well, you have made an exceptional capture here and I congratulate you for it.', '2005-04-11 01:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283195, 161175, 32767, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 on this one. I was looking for more posed shots and found too many of sleeping animals. I''ve never seen people sleeping in portraits. This was in the middle somewhere and the hair in front of the eye may have hurt a dash as well.<br/> <br/>Please comment on my shot if you have the time.</td>', 'I gave you a 7 on this one. I was looking for more posed shots and found too many of sleeping animals. I''ve never seen people sleeping in portraits. This was in the middle somewhere and the hair in front of the eye may have hurt a dash as well. Please comment on my shot if you have the time.', '2005-04-11 01:27:43.000000', NULL, 0),
