(1283505, 162863, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, Laurie, this is one of the best ones in the bunch. I am kind of impartial to all chihuahuas, as I have 3 of these wonderful babies at home. Peanut sure is a cutie! The photo is really good. It expresses the gentle warm quality of a chihuahua. Generally, people think of them as yappy annoying dogs, but they really miss the whole point. They are truly one of the loveliest breeds around. Congrats on the great 5th place. It''s a winner in my heart!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-11 02:45:30.</i></td>', 'Oh, Laurie, this is one of the best ones in the bunch. I am kind of impartial to all chihuahuas, as I have 3 of these wonderful babies at home. Peanut sure is a cutie! The photo is really good. It expresses the gentle warm quality of a chihuahua. Generally, people think of them as yappy annoying dogs, but they really miss the whole point. They are truly one of the loveliest breeds around. Congrats on the great 5th place. It''s a winner in my heart!', '2005-04-11 03:44:34.000000', '2005-04-11 03:45:30.000000', 0),
