(1283888, 163087, 32754, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you missed top 10, but only by one..This shot was superb: the lighting, the subject and the use of the skull make it look like something out of Shakespeare..congratulations! Thanks for the outtakes..I like the one coming in one eye and out the other..looks like a poster for a movie.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-11 09:29:53.</i></td>', 'I don''t know how you missed top 10, but only by one..This shot was superb: the lighting, the subject and the use of the skull make it look like something out of Shakespeare..congratulations! Thanks for the outtakes..I like the one coming in one eye and out the other..looks like a poster for a movie.', '2005-04-11 10:28:33.000000', '2005-04-11 10:29:53.000000', 0),
(1283901, 162229, 12448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by typologic:</b></div><hr/><i> Technically you have a great shot here! The colours, lighting and sharpness are wonderful. But this isn''t my idea of a domesticated pet :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Then you never Matilda, my father''s hen.  Chickens and Roosters can actually make wonderful pets.  Matilda would greet my father every morning when he went out to feed, sit on his arm as he gathered eggs and would actually nuzzle his ear!  They are so much fun to watch!<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by typologic: Technically you have a great shot here! The colours, lighting and sharpness are wonderful. But this isn''t my idea of a domesticated pet :)   Then you never Matilda, my father''s hen.  Chickens and Roosters can actually make wonderful pets.  Matilda would greet my father every morning when he went out to feed, sit on his arm as he gathered eggs and would actually nuzzle his ear!  They are so much fun to watch!', '2005-04-11 10:36:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283922, 161470, 12448, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to this shot during the challenge but wanted to come back and let you know I gave this one an 8.  I really like the overall feel of the shot and the use of lighting is wonderful.  Just one thing really bugged me about the overall shot, the lower right corner, the leg seems to come out of nowhere and then is gone, maybe just a little tighter crop on that side to really give the negative space on the other side the chance to really enhance the kitty.</td>', 'I didn''t get to this shot during the challenge but wanted to come back and let you know I gave this one an 8.  I really like the overall feel of the shot and the use of lighting is wonderful.  Just one thing really bugged me about the overall shot, the lower right corner, the leg seems to come out of nowhere and then is gone, maybe just a little tighter crop on that side to really give the negative space on the other side the chance to really enhance the kitty.', '2005-04-11 10:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
