(1284391, 162925, 29904, '<td valign="top">Really a great shot, don''t know why it did not do better, accept ignorance?  My friend has some doggles, and her dog absolutly freezes still when they are on!  Great focus and dof, great catch with the tongue!  The only thing that bugs me is the yellow reflection under his eye.  Gave you a 10 anyways :)</td>', 'Really a great shot, don''t know why it did not do better, accept ignorance?  My friend has some doggles, and her dog absolutly freezes still when they are on!  Great focus and dof, great catch with the tongue!  The only thing that bugs me is the yellow reflection under his eye.  Gave you a 10 anyways :)', '2005-04-11 16:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284408, 162940, 1570, '<td valign="top">it''s a great story, deannda, i am so glad you guys found each other... it was meant to be... one note about his original owner(s) - i just don''t "get" people like that... irina. <br/> <br/>PS: i sent the url to all of my "dog" friends, so they could read about it, too...</td>', 'it''s a great story, deannda, i am so glad you guys found each other... it was meant to be... one note about his original owner(s) - i just don''t "get" people like that... irina.  PS: i sent the url to all of my "dog" friends, so they could read about it, too...', '2005-04-11 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284410, 162434, 29904, '<td valign="top">I scored you high because I felt it was really well done and I know how difficulst it is to do a fish shot!  I only wish the snail was easier to see.  Great focus and the translucence is daring.  I agree with all the other comments.  I guess it didn''t strike enough ''cutsie fancies''.</td>', 'I scored you high because I felt it was really well done and I know how difficulst it is to do a fish shot!  I only wish the snail was easier to see.  Great focus and the translucence is daring.  I agree with all the other comments.  I guess it didn''t strike enough ''cutsie fancies''.', '2005-04-11 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
