(1284421, 162973, 29904, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one and scored it high, but I have to agree with clarmore on why it may have not scored higher, plus I think the red in the foreground is a little over-powering, distracts some from your wonderful subject.  Otherwise, very nice tonal range and detail. :)</td>', 'I really liked this one and scored it high, but I have to agree with clarmore on why it may have not scored higher, plus I think the red in the foreground is a little over-powering, distracts some from your wonderful subject.  Otherwise, very nice tonal range and detail. :)', '2005-04-11 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
