(1284444, 163107, 29904, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one, gave a 9,  I only wish the background, what looks like a hap-hazard bed pillow, was a pancho or mexican weave blanket - but well blurred so as not to add too much distracting texture as the pillow does.  Beautiful lighting!  Great hat, nice dof and other textures.<br/> <br/>I think living with two boxers would freak me out too, Selena  ;))</td>', 'I really liked this one, gave a 9,  I only wish the background, what looks like a hap-hazard bed pillow, was a pancho or mexican weave blanket - but well blurred so as not to add too much distracting texture as the pillow does.  Beautiful lighting!  Great hat, nice dof and other textures. I think living with two boxers would freak me out too, Selena  ;))', '2005-04-11 16:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
