(1284452, 162982, 29904, '<td valign="top">Dang! I like this one, It''s a really good catch!  good lighting, focus, detail where it belongs.  I agree with almost all the comments.  I think the presence of the colorful stuffed animals add character, which is an extra element that a lot of perfecting photographers forget.  Nice portrait!</td>', 'Dang! I like this one, It''s a really good catch!  good lighting, focus, detail where it belongs.  I agree with almost all the comments.  I think the presence of the colorful stuffed animals add character, which is an extra element that a lot of perfecting photographers forget.  Nice portrait!', '2005-04-11 16:47:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284464, 162122, 29904, '<td valign="top">I too, believe this should have scored higher, it is an excellent portrait!  Great lighting, composition, textures, tones, and esp expression!  The only thing I would change is to crop it tighter, solely for this venue.  Our view is so limited with only 640 pixel length, that you want to get all you can in there, I think.  (Perhaps a landscape crop would work better with the lines?)  I know when someone submits a photo very small, and I can''t see it clearly, it is discouraging.  I can''t decide if the lack of floor molding is distracting or adds a touch of character.</td>', 'I too, believe this should have scored higher, it is an excellent portrait!  Great lighting, composition, textures, tones, and esp expression!  The only thing I would change is to crop it tighter, solely for this venue.  Our view is so limited with only 640 pixel length, that you want to get all you can in there, I think.  (Perhaps a landscape crop would work better with the lines?)  I know when someone submits a photo very small, and I can''t see it clearly, it is discouraging.  I can''t decide if the lack of floor molding is distracting or adds a touch of character.', '2005-04-11 16:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284475, 162990, 8367, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Congratulations! Excellent lighting.', '2005-04-11 17:10:06.000000', NULL, 0),
