(1284550, 162990, 13113, '<td valign="top">HOW ADORABLE! I didn''t get done commenting on all the pictures so sorry I couldn''t make it to yours. But if I did I would have given you a 10 if I could vote! This is so adorable and congrats on your third place because that dog is just extraordinary!</td>', 'HOW ADORABLE! I didn''t get done commenting on all the pictures so sorry I couldn''t make it to yours. But if I did I would have given you a 10 if I could vote! This is so adorable and congrats on your third place because that dog is just extraordinary!', '2005-04-11 18:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284567, 161390, 29904, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot!  The first thing that caught my eye was this cat''s gorgeous coat, never seen this breed before (not just a tabby), quite stunning.  The next I saw was the contrasting size and roughness of the mastiff.  The warm light beautifully envelopes the obvious sun-worshipers and the darkness only exemplifies that this is the one comfy warm spot to stake claim to.  The circle in the rug pattern contains kitty neatly.  It is a gorgeous study in contrasts of light and dark, slick/soft and rough, peace and attentiveness. Very well titled.  Congrats!!</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot!  The first thing that caught my eye was this cat''s gorgeous coat, never seen this breed before (not just a tabby), quite stunning.  The next I saw was the contrasting size and roughness of the mastiff.  The warm light beautifully envelopes the obvious sun-worshipers and the darkness only exemplifies that this is the one comfy warm spot to stake claim to.  The circle in the rug pattern contains kitty neatly.  It is a gorgeous study in contrasts of light and dark, slick/soft and rough, peace and attentiveness. Very well titled.  Congrats!!', '2005-04-11 18:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284608, 162819, 6520, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite!</td>', 'This was my favorite!', '2005-04-11 18:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284609, 163018, 7711, '<td valign="top">my favourite of the challenge! Extremely well done portrait and beautiful bw to boot. :)</td>', 'my favourite of the challenge! Extremely well done portrait and beautiful bw to boot. :)', '2005-04-11 18:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284615, 161498, 6520, '<td valign="top">I agree, should have placed higher!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-11 17:48:42.</i></td>', 'I agree, should have placed higher!!', '2005-04-11 18:48:25.000000', '2005-04-11 18:48:42.000000', 0),
(1284643, 161791, 29904, '<td valign="top">Two things that esp caught my attention, 1 how you got a quick action shot in low enough light to get those pupils so big.  Even in play mode the pupils are not fully dialated in decent lighting.  Kudos on your expertise there.  2 I love the dof and the clear texture in the rug.  Some might think it distracts but for me it adds interest and leads you to his captivating expression!  Wonderful focus, you even got the texture around the pupils!</td>', 'Two things that esp caught my attention, 1 how you got a quick action shot in low enough light to get those pupils so big.  Even in play mode the pupils are not fully dialated in decent lighting.  Kudos on your expertise there.  2 I love the dof and the clear texture in the rug.  Some might think it distracts but for me it adds interest and leads you to his captivating expression!  Wonderful focus, you even got the texture around the pupils!', '2005-04-11 19:10:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284646, 161837, 13113, '<td valign="top">This is a cool cat and caught him perfectly!That is cool and I like it so much I could just laugh out loud all day! LOL! I think that you could have got a higher place though.</td>', 'This is a cool cat and caught him perfectly!That is cool and I like it so much I could just laugh out loud all day! LOL! I think that you could have got a higher place though.', '2005-04-11 19:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
