(1286428, 162950, 5266, '<td valign="top">So this is where my Gus (<a href="//www.pbase.com/kiml/image/21818363" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/kiml/image/21818363</a>) was last week when I was looking for him!!<br/> <br/>I think you''ve done a good job with Clyde - I know from trying to get good Gus pics that the flash reflects off him and he just looks like a big shine.  Ambient light is usually best for this color of animal.<br/> <br/>I do agree that the person in the background and the pattern on the cushions is distracting - would have been better on a solid color.  <br/> <br/>But he''s beautiful!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-12 20:41:43.</i></td>', 'So this is where my Gus (//www.pbase.com/kiml/image/21818363) was last week when I was looking for him!! I think you''ve done a good job with Clyde - I know from trying to get good Gus pics that the flash reflects off him and he just looks like a big shine.  Ambient light is usually best for this color of animal. I do agree that the person in the background and the pattern on the cushions is distracting - would have been better on a solid color.   But he''s beautiful!!!', '2005-04-12 21:41:07.000000', '2005-04-12 21:41:43.000000', 0),
