(1286582, 162990, 33736, '<td valign="top"><b>I am soooooooo in love</b> - anytime George wants to run away from home ........  (pack his suitcase and buy him a ticket to Michigan!)<br/> <br/>this is from a woman who thinks the best way to have children is to let your sisters do it, and dogs were meant to live at someone else''s house.<br/> <br/>George is beautiful (handsome?  dignified?  generous? kind? loving?)<br/> <br/>It is your composition, background choice, and lighting which caught my eye.   I truly loved this picture; wasn''t able to vote, but would have given it at least a 9 - and more likely, a 10.<br/> <br/>Kathy</td>', 'I am soooooooo in love - anytime George wants to run away from home ........  (pack his suitcase and buy him a ticket to Michigan!) this is from a woman who thinks the best way to have children is to let your sisters do it, and dogs were meant to live at someone else''s house. George is beautiful (handsome?  dignified?  generous? kind? loving?) It is your composition, background choice, and lighting which caught my eye.   I truly loved this picture; wasn''t able to vote, but would have given it at least a 9 - and more likely, a 10. Kathy', '2005-04-12 23:10:26.000000', NULL, 0),
