(1314521, 161788, 6306, '<td valign="top">Amazing exposure. The tones on the dog are great. <br/> <br/>I do, however, notice some weirdness in this image. The pose is very unnatural, considering that he is "climbing out of a ditch". Also, I notice some editing done (cloning?) below the left leg, by his belly.  Kinda weird looking. At first glance, it looks awesome, but then the pose and the entire image appears strange.<br/> <br/>The dog has been swallowed by the grass.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-22 23:05:04.</i></td>', 'Amazing exposure. The tones on the dog are great.  I do, however, notice some weirdness in this image. The pose is very unnatural, considering that he is "climbing out of a ditch". Also, I notice some editing done (cloning?) below the left leg, by his belly.  Kinda weird looking. At first glance, it looks awesome, but then the pose and the entire image appears strange. The dog has been swallowed by the grass.', '2005-04-22 23:59:28.000000', '2005-04-23 00:05:04.000000', 0),
