(2310992, 162559, 7322, '<td valign="top">This fellow looks like my Opie, only with more true Aussie character to his face. Opie''s muzzle is a bit longish for an Aussie. Also, this is a better photo. :D<br/> <br/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=300397" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/300397.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/300397.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/300397.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>oops! I see now Bikkie is a girl not a fellow. So sorry...:D<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-13 21:05:51.</i></td>', 'This fellow looks like my Opie, only with more true Aussie character to his face. Opie''s muzzle is a bit longish for an Aussie. Also, this is a better photo. :D    oops! I see now Bikkie is a girl not a fellow. So sorry...:D', '2006-04-13 21:42:14.000000', '2006-04-13 22:05:51.000000', 0),
