(3468161, 162863, 49652, '<td valign="top">Laurie,<br/>I am so sorry to hear about Peanut.  I know that pets become like our children and losing one is just devastating.  You will always have your precious memories and Peanut lives on in your heart.  And you have this brilliant portrait of him, even if he is in drag.  Hang tough, Laurie!  It does get better.<br/>Thinking of you,<br/>Dawn</td>', 'Laurie,I am so sorry to hear about Peanut.  I know that pets become like our children and losing one is just devastating.  You will always have your precious memories and Peanut lives on in your heart.  And you have this brilliant portrait of him, even if he is in drag.  Hang tough, Laurie!  It does get better.Thinking of you,Dawn', '2007-03-17 09:24:29.000000', NULL, 0),
