(4008769, 162863, 67145, '<td valign="top">an excellent pet portrait .. i am so sorry that your gorgeous little dog was killed .. we have a miniature fox terrier, katee .. (the breed was created by crossing fox terrier with chihuahua) .. my daughter wanted a lap dog so we got katee, who is so not a lap dog, altho we didnt know that when she was 6 weeks old  ... she is the most active little thing ever &amp; also extremely intelligent .. of course i''d say that being totally biased !! ..  its now over five months since your little peanut was taken ...  my heart goes out to you even so .. i''m sure five months would''t be even close to long enough, for us to ''get over'' the loss if anything happened to our little katee .. :)</td>', 'an excellent pet portrait .. i am so sorry that your gorgeous little dog was killed .. we have a miniature fox terrier, katee .. (the breed was created by crossing fox terrier with chihuahua) .. my daughter wanted a lap dog so we got katee, who is so not a lap dog, altho we didnt know that when she was 6 weeks old  ... she is the most active little thing ever & also extremely intelligent .. of course i''d say that being totally biased !! ..  its now over five months since your little peanut was taken ...  my heart goes out to you even so .. i''m sure five months would''t be even close to long enough, for us to ''get over'' the loss if anything happened to our little katee .. :)', '2007-08-18 08:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
