(4352650, 162987, 63267, '<td valign="top">What a great looking boxer.  I miss my boxer, he is still in the states with his grandma.  Fortunately I have his cousin, my little English Bully here to keep me company though.<br/> <br/>This is a great pet protrait, and the stance of Zane really shows the posture and attitude of this wonderful breed.<br/> <br/>Great shot!</td>', 'What a great looking boxer.  I miss my boxer, he is still in the states with his grandma.  Fortunately I have his cousin, my little English Bully here to keep me company though. This is a great pet protrait, and the stance of Zane really shows the posture and attitude of this wonderful breed. Great shot!', '2008-01-02 03:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
