(5467939, 161788, 14476, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> For all those who commented on Karma''s "missing ass", she''s climbing out of a ditch, and she froze in mid-climb when some birds broke cover. It''s by far the best shot I have ever had of her face, so I entered it despite the weird pose. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>And by entering her in this ''weird'' pose, you made her world-famous.<br/>:-))</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: For all those who commented on Karma''s "missing ass", she''s climbing out of a ditch, and she froze in mid-climb when some birds broke cover. It''s by far the best shot I have ever had of her face, so I entered it despite the weird pose.  And by entering her in this ''weird'' pose, you made her world-famous.:-))', '2009-05-04 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 0),
